#: src/features/Feature/featuresData.ts:208
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"## Create your own speaking scenario\n"
"\n"
"Custom Role Play lets you build a conversation around your own situation "
"instead of choosing only from predefined options.\n"
"\n"
"## What you can customize\n"
"\n"
"You can create role plays for:\n"
"- work meetings\n"
"- travel situations\n"
"- customer communication\n"
"- personal speaking challenges\n"
"- any specific English scenario you want to practice\n"
"\n"
"## Why it helps\n"
"\n"
"This gives you more control over your learning and makes speaking practice "
"highly relevant to your real life.\n"
"\n"
"The result is personalized AI conversation practice that matches your exact "
"context."
msgstr ""
"## Cipta senario bercakap anda sendiri\n"
"\n"
"Main Peranan Tersuai membolehkan anda membina perbualan berdasarkan situasi "
"anda sendiri dan bukannya memilih hanya daripada pilihan yang telah "
"ditetapkan.\n"
"\n"
"## Apa yang anda boleh sesuaikan\n"
"\n"
"Anda boleh mencipta main peranan untuk:\n"
"- mesyuarat kerja\n"
"- situasi perjalanan\n"
"- komunikasi pelanggan\n"
"- cabaran bercakap peribadi\n"
"- mana-mana senario Bahasa Inggeris tertentu yang anda ingin latih\n"
"\n"
"## Mengapa ia membantu\n"
"\n"
"Ini memberi anda lebih kawalan ke atas pembelajaran anda dan menjadikan "
"latihan bercakap sangat relevan kepada kehidupan sebenar anda.\n"
"\n"
"Keputusan adalah amalan perbualan AI yang diperibadikan yang sesuai dengan "
"konteks anda yang sebenar."

#: src/features/Feature/featuresData.ts:524
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"## Earn points and stay motivated\n"
"\n"
"FluencyPal tracks your activity across the platform and rewards regular "
"practice with points.\n"
"\n"
"## How points are earned\n"
"\n"
"You can earn points through:\n"
"- AI conversations\n"
"- stories quizzes\n"
"- daily questions\n"
"- community activity\n"
"- game mode\n"
"\n"
"## Why it helps\n"
"\n"
"The leaderboard creates a clear motivation loop for long-term consistency. "
"Top users can unlock rewards while they remain at the top.\n"
"\n"
"This makes progress more visible and practice more engaging."
msgstr ""
"## Dapatkan mata dan kekal bermotivasi\n"
"\n"
"FluencyPal menjejaki aktiviti anda di seluruh platform dan memberi ganjaran "
"latihan berkala dengan mata.\n"
"\n"
"## Bagaimana mata diperoleh\n"
"\n"
"Anda boleh memperoleh mata melalui:\n"
"- perbualan AI\n"
"- kuiz cerita\n"
"- soalan harian\n"
"- aktiviti komuniti\n"
"- mod permainan\n"
"\n"
"## Mengapa ia membantu\n"
"\n"
"Papan pendahulu mencipta gelung motivasi yang jelas untuk konsistensi "
"jangka panjang. Pengguna teratas boleh membuka ganjaran sementara mereka "
"kekal di atas.\n"
"\n"
"Ini menjadikan kemajuan lebih mudah dilihat dan latihan lebih menarik."

#: src/features/Feature/featuresData.ts:415
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"## Gamified English practice\n"
"\n"
"Game mode turns language learning into a set of interactive challenges that "
"reward regular practice.\n"
"\n"
"## Types of activities\n"
"\n"
"You can practice through tasks such as:\n"
"- translating words\n"
"- building sentences\n"
"- reading short texts\n"
"- answering speaking questions\n"
"\n"
"## Why it helps\n"
"\n"
"You earn points for correct answers, which adds motivation and makes it "
"easier to stay consistent.\n"
"\n"
"Gamified learning helps improve vocabulary, reading, sentence building, and "
"speaking in a more engaging format."
msgstr ""
"## Latihan Bahasa Inggeris Secara Bermain\n"
"\n"
"Mod permainan merubah pembelajaran bahasa menjadi satu set cabaran "
"interaktif yang memberi ganjaran kepada latihan berulang.\n"
"\n"
"## Jenis-Jenis Aktiviti\n"
"\n"
"Anda boleh berlatih melalui tugasan seperti:\n"
"- menterjemah perkataan\n"
"- membina ayat\n"
"- membaca teks pendek\n"
"- menjawab soalan lisan\n"
"\n"
"## Kenapa ia membantu\n"
"\n"
"Anda memperoleh mata untuk jawapan yang betul, yang menambah motivasi dan "
"memudahkan untuk kekal konsisten.\n"
"\n"
"Pembelajaran secara bermain membantu meningkatkan perbendaharaan kata, "
"membaca, pembinaan ayat, dan bercakap dalam format yang lebih menarik."

#: src/features/Feature/featuresData.ts:96
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"## Grammar practice based on your real mistakes\n"
"\n"
"After conversations, FluencyPal creates a personalized grammar list based "
"on the errors you actually make while speaking or writing.\n"
"\n"
"## What each rule includes\n"
"\n"
"Each grammar item includes:\n"
"- a simple explanation\n"
"- clear examples\n"
"- a short quiz\n"
"- AI conversation practice for the same rule\n"
"\n"
"## Goal-aligned preparation\n"
"\n"
"FluencyPal can also prioritize grammar patterns based on the kind of "
"English you need to use, such as:\n"
"- job interviews\n"
"- travel communication\n"
"- everyday conversations\n"
"- formal speaking\n"
"\n"
"## How the learning loop works\n"
"\n"
"You improve grammar in three steps:\n"
"1. understand the rule\n"
"2. practice it in a quiz\n"
"3. apply it in real conversation\n"
"\n"
"## Why it helps\n"
"\n"
"This approach makes grammar practice more personal and more practical. "
"Instead of reviewing random rules, you focus on the patterns that are "
"slowing down your real English communication and the rules you are most "
"likely to need next."
msgstr ""
"## Latihan Tatabahasa Berdasarkan Kesilapan Sebenar Anda\n"
"\n"
"Selepas perbualan, FluencyPal mencipta senarai tatabahasa peribadi "
"berdasarkan kesilapan yang anda benar-benar buat ketika bercakap atau "
"menulis.\n"
"\n"
"## Apa yang setiap peraturan termasuk\n"
"\n"
"Setiap item tatabahasa termasuk:\n"
"- penjelasan ringkas\n"
"- contoh yang jelas\n"
"- kuiz ringkas\n"
"- latihan perbualan AI untuk peraturan yang sama\n"
"\n"
"## Persediaan yang Selaras dengan Matlamat\n"
"\n"
"FluencyPal juga boleh mengutamakan corak tatabahasa berdasarkan jenis "
"bahasa Inggeris yang anda perlu gunakan, seperti:\n"
"- temu duga kerja\n"
"- komunikasi semasa perjalanan\n"
"- perbualan harian\n"
"- percakapan formal\n"
"\n"
"## Bagaimana Gelung Pembelajaran Berfungsi\n"
"\n"
"Anda meningkatkan tatabahasa dalam tiga langkah:\n"
"1. memahami peraturan tersebut\n"
"2. berlatih dalam kuiz\n"
"3. menerapkannya dalam perbualan sebenar\n"
"\n"
"## Mengapa Ia Membantu\n"
"\n"
"Pendekatan ini membuatkan latihan tatabahasa lebih peribadi dan lebih "
"praktikal. Daripada menyemak peraturan secara rawak, anda memberi fokus "
"pada corak yang memperlahankan komunikasi bahasa Inggeris sebenar anda dan "
"peraturan yang paling mungkin anda perlukan seterusnya."

#: src/features/Feature/featuresData.ts:242
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"## Improve English through interactive stories\n"
"\n"
"With Stories, you listen to English content while reading the original text "
"and translation side by side.\n"
"\n"
"## How the quiz works\n"
"\n"
"After listening, you complete a quiz where you rebuild parts of the text "
"word by word. This helps you notice:\n"
"- sentence structure\n"
"- word order\n"
"- common language patterns\n"
"\n"
"## Why it helps\n"
"\n"
"Stories combine reading, listening, and active reconstruction. This makes "
"them a practical alternative to passive content consumption and a useful "
"way to practice during commutes or short breaks."
msgstr ""
"## Tingkatkan Bahasa Inggeris melalui cerita interaktif\n"
"\n"
"Dengan Cerita, anda mendengar kandungan dalam Bahasa Inggeris sambil "
"membaca teks asal dan terjemahan secara bersebelahan.\n"
"\n"
"## Bagaimana kuiz berfungsi\n"
"\n"
"Selepas mendengar, anda melengkapkan kuiz di mana anda menyusun semula "
"bahagian teks perkataan demi perkataan. Ini membantu anda menyedari:\n"
"- struktur ayat\n"
"- susunan perkataan\n"
"- corak bahasa biasa\n"
"\n"
"## Kenapa ia membantu\n"
"\n"
"Cerita menggabungkan pembacaan, pendengaran, dan penyusunan semula yang "
"aktif. Ini menjadikannya alternatif praktikal kepada penggunaan kandungan "
"pasif dan cara yang berguna untuk berlatih semasa perjalanan atau rehat "
"pendek."

#: src/features/Feature/featuresData.ts:144
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"## Learn vocabulary that matches your goals\n"
"\n"
"FluencyPal builds vocabulary lessons around the words that are most useful "
"for your personal goal and current level.\n"
"\n"
"## How it works\n"
"\n"
"At the start of each lesson, the system selects words that match:\n"
"- your learning objective\n"
"- your current vocabulary level\n"
"- the situations you want to handle in English\n"
"\n"
"Then the AI teacher explains the words and helps you use them in guided "
"conversation.\n"
"\n"
"## Why it helps\n"
"\n"
"You do not just memorize isolated vocabulary. You practice words in "
"context, which makes them easier to remember and easier to use in real "
"speech.\n"
"\n"
"At the same time, FluencyPal continues improving your grammar guidance in "
"parallel."
msgstr ""
"## Belajar perbendaharaan kata yang sesuai dengan matlamat anda\n"
"\n"
"FluencyPal membentuk pelajaran perbendaharaan kata berdasarkan perkataan "
"yang paling berguna untuk matlamat peribadi dan tahap semasa anda.\n"
"\n"
"## Bagaimana ia berfungsi\n"
"\n"
"Pada permulaan setiap pelajaran, sistem memilih perkataan yang sepadan "
"dengan:\n"
"- objektif pembelajaran anda\n"
"- tahap perbendaharaan kata semasa anda\n"
"- situasi yang anda ingin hadapi dalam Bahasa Inggeris\n"
"\n"
"Kemudian guru AI menerangkan perkataan tersebut dan membantu anda "
"menggunakannya dalam perbualan berpandu.\n"
"\n"
"## Mengapa ia membantu\n"
"\n"
"Anda tidak hanya menghafal perbendaharaan kata yang terasing. Anda berlatih "
"perkataan dalam konteks, yang menjadikannya lebih mudah untuk diingati dan "
"lebih mudah digunakan dalam pertuturan sebenar.\n"
"\n"
"Pada masa yang sama, FluencyPal terus memperbaiki panduan tatabahasa anda "
"secara selari."

#: src/features/Feature/featuresData.ts:495
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"## Learn with other people\n"
"\n"
"FluencyPal includes community chats where learners can interact beyond "
"one-on-one AI practice.\n"
"\n"
"## What you can do\n"
"\n"
"In the community, you can:\n"
"- ask questions\n"
"- share progress\n"
"- discuss learning challenges\n"
"- stay motivated with other learners\n"
"\n"
"## Why it helps\n"
"\n"
"This adds a social layer to language learning and gives you more "
"opportunities to use English in meaningful ways.\n"
"\n"
"Some community functions may require age verification depending on the "
"feature."
msgstr ""
"## Belajar bersama orang lain\n"
"\n"
"FluencyPal merangkumi sembang komuniti di mana pelajar boleh berinteraksi "
"lebih daripada latihan AI satu lawan satu.\n"
"\n"
"## Apa yang anda boleh lakukan\n"
"\n"
"Dalam komuniti, anda boleh:\n"
"- bertanya soalan\n"
"- berkongsi kemajuan\n"
"- membincangkan cabaran pembelajaran\n"
"- kekal bermotivasi dengan pelajar lain\n"
"\n"
"## Mengapa ia membantu\n"
"\n"
"Ini menambah lapisan sosial kepada pembelajaran bahasa dan memberi anda "
"lebih banyak peluang untuk menggunakan Bahasa Inggeris dengan cara yang "
"bermakna.\n"
"\n"
"Beberapa fungsi komuniti mungkin memerlukan pengesahan umur bergantung pada "
"ciri tersebut."

#: src/features/Feature/featuresData.ts:342
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"## Practice English with real current events\n"
"\n"
"The News feature turns today’s real headlines into English practice "
"material. Stories are pulled from gNews for your country, translated into "
"the language you are learning, and rewritten by AI at a complexity level "
"that matches your skill.\n"
"\n"
"## How it works\n"
"\n"
"Each day FluencyPal:\n"
"- fetches current news for your country (or any supported country you "
"choose)\n"
"- rewrites the article at three complexity levels so it stays readable for "
"you\n"
"- shows the story on your dashboard with the original image and a short "
"headline\n"
"\n"
"You can switch the news country and complexity level at any time from the "
"news settings.\n"
"\n"
"## Discuss the story with AI\n"
"\n"
"From the news card you can open the full article and start a voice or text "
"discussion about it with the AI tutor. The AI uses the article as the "
"topic, so you practice:\n"
"- expressing opinions about real events\n"
"- summarizing what you read\n"
"- asking and answering questions about the story\n"
"- using vocabulary that appears in everyday news\n"
"\n"
"## Why it helps\n"
"\n"
"Real news gives you something fresh to talk about every day, which keeps "
"practice interesting and connected to the world you live in. Because the "
"text is rewritten at your level, you stay challenged without getting stuck "
"on unfamiliar wording, and the AI discussion turns a passive reading "
"session into active English speaking practice.\n"
"\n"
"Completing a news discussion also counts toward your daily tasks, so the "
"habit fits naturally into the rest of your learning routine."
msgstr ""
"## Berlatih Bahasa Inggeris dengan acara semasa sebenar\n"
"\n"
"Ciri Berita menukar tajuk utama sebenar hari ini menjadi bahan latihan "
"Bahasa Inggeris. Cerita ditarik dari gNews untuk negara anda, diterjemahkan "
"ke dalam bahasa yang anda pelajari, dan ditulis semula oleh AI pada tahap "
"kesukaran yang sepadan dengan kemahiran anda.\n"
"\n"
"## Bagaimana ia berfungsi\n"
"\n"
"Setiap hari FluencyPal:\n"
"- mendapatkan berita semasa untuk negara anda (atau mana-mana negara yang "
"disokong pilihan anda)\n"
"- menulis semula artikel pada tiga tahap kesukaran supaya ia kekal mudah "
"dibaca untuk anda\n"
"- memaparkan cerita di papan pemuka anda dengan imej asal dan tajuk ringkas\n"
"\n"
"Anda boleh menukar negara berita dan tahap kesukaran pada bila-bila masa "
"dari tetapan berita.\n"
"\n"
"## Bincangkan cerita dengan AI\n"
"\n"
"Dari kad berita, anda boleh membuka artikel penuh dan memulakan "
"perbincangan suara atau teks mengenainya dengan tutor AI. AI menggunakan "
"artikel tersebut sebagai topik, jadi anda berlatih:\n"
"- menyatakan pendapat tentang acara sebenar\n"
"- merumuskan apa yang anda baca\n"
"- bertanya dan menjawab soalan tentang cerita\n"
"- menggunakan perbendaharaan kata yang muncul dalam berita harian\n"
"\n"
"## Kenapa ia membantu\n"
"\n"
"Berita sebenar memberi anda sesuatu yang segar untuk dibincang setiap hari, "
"yang menjadikan latihan menarik dan berkaitan dengan dunia yang anda diami. "
"Oleh kerana teks ditulis semula pada tahap anda, anda kekal tercabar tanpa "
"tersekat pada kata-kata yang tidak dikenali, dan perbincangan AI menukar "
"sesi bacaan pasif menjadi latihan bercakap Bahasa Inggeris aktif.\n"
"\n"
"Menyelesaikan perbincangan berita juga dikira ke arah tugas harian anda, "
"jadi tabiat tersebut sesuai secara semula jadi ke dalam rutin pembelajaran "
"anda yang lain."

#: src/features/Feature/featuresData.ts:174
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"## Practice real-life English scenarios\n"
"\n"
"FluencyPal uses AI role plays to help you practice conversations that match "
"your real needs.\n"
"\n"
"## Goal-based role plays\n"
"\n"
"If your goal is related to work, your role plays may include:\n"
"- recruiter screening\n"
"- job interviews\n"
"- technical interviews\n"
"- salary discussions\n"
"\n"
"## Everyday speaking scenarios\n"
"\n"
"You also get ready-made role plays for practical communication, such as:\n"
"- shop conversations\n"
"- support calls\n"
"- everyday speaking situations\n"
"\n"
"## Why it helps\n"
"\n"
"Role play practice helps you prepare for real conversations before they "
"happen. It makes English speaking practice more realistic, more useful, and "
"easier to transfer into everyday life."
msgstr ""
"## Amalkan senario Bahasa Inggeris sebenar\n"
"\n"
"FluencyPal menggunakan lakonan peranan AI untuk membantu anda berlatih "
"perbualan yang sesuai dengan keperluan sebenar anda.\n"
"\n"
"## Lakonan peranan berdasarkan matlamat\n"
"\n"
"Jika matlamat anda berkaitan dengan kerja, lakonan peranan anda mungkin "
"termasuk:\n"
"- penapisan perekrut\n"
"- temu duga kerja\n"
"- temu duga teknikal\n"
"- perbincangan gaji\n"
"\n"
"## Senario bercakap harian\n"
"\n"
"Anda juga mendapat lakonan peranan sedia ada untuk komunikasi praktikal, "
"seperti:\n"
"- perbualan di kedai\n"
"- panggilan sokongan\n"
"- situasi bercakap setiap hari\n"
"\n"
"## Kenapa ia membantu\n"
"\n"
"Amalan lakonan peranan membantu anda bersedia untuk perbualan sebenar "
"sebelum ia berlaku. Ini menjadikan amalan bercakap Bahasa Inggeris lebih "
"realistik, lebih berguna, dan lebih mudah untuk dipindahkan ke dalam "
"kehidupan harian."

#: src/features/Feature/featuresData.ts:307
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"## Practice speaking every day\n"
"\n"
"Daily Questions gives you one new English speaking prompt each day.\n"
"\n"
"## What you practice\n"
"\n"
"This feature helps you practice:\n"
"- expressing opinions\n"
"- organizing thoughts\n"
"- answering unexpected questions\n"
"- speaking with more confidence\n"
"\n"
"## Extra value\n"
"\n"
"You can also see answers from other learners, compare ideas, and discover "
"new ways to respond.\n"
"\n"
"This makes daily practice simple, consistent, and useful for real spoken "
"English."
msgstr ""
"## Berlatih bercakap setiap hari\n"
"\n"
"Soalan Harian memberikan anda satu petunjuk baru untuk berbicara dalam "
"Bahasa Inggeris setiap hari.\n"
"\n"
"## Apa yang anda pelajari\n"
"\n"
"Fitur ini membantu anda berlatih:\n"
"- menyatakan pendapat\n"
"- mengatur pemikiran\n"
"- menjawab soalan yang tidak dijangka\n"
"- bercakap dengan lebih yakin\n"
"\n"
"## Nilai tambahan\n"
"\n"
"Anda juga boleh melihat jawapan daripada pelajar lain, membandingkan idea, "
"dan menemui cara baru untuk menjawab.\n"
"\n"
"Ini menjadikan latihan harian mudah, konsisten, dan berguna untuk Bahasa "
"Inggeris yang sebenar."

#: src/features/Feature/featuresData.ts:57
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"## Practice spoken English in different ways\n"
"\n"
"FluencyPal gives you several ways to practice speaking English with AI, so "
"you can choose the format that fits your day, your confidence level, and "
"your learning style.\n"
"\n"
"## Available speaking modes\n"
"\n"
"### Call Mode\n"
"Talk naturally with an AI English tutor and follow the transcript during "
"the conversation.\n"
"\n"
"### Voice Message Mode\n"
"Record your answer, review AI suggestions, improve your response, and send "
"it when ready.\n"
"\n"
"### Chat Mode\n"
"Type your reply when speaking out loud is not convenient.\n"
"\n"
"## Extra support during conversation\n"
"\n"
"You can:\n"
"- adjust AI speaking speed\n"
"- use transcripts to follow the conversation\n"
"- get help when you do not know what to say next\n"
"\n"
"## Why it helps\n"
"\n"
"While you practice, FluencyPal tracks mistakes and turns them into targeted "
"improvement tasks. This helps you improve English speaking confidence, "
"fluency, and speaking accuracy over time."
msgstr ""
"## Berlatih bertutur dalam bahasa Inggeris dengan cara yang berbeza\n"
"\n"
"FluencyPal memberi anda beberapa cara untuk berlatih bercakap bahasa "
"Inggeris dengan AI, supaya anda dapat memilih format yang sesuai dengan "
"hari anda, tahap keyakinan anda, dan gaya pembelajaran anda.\n"
"\n"
"## Mod bercakap yang tersedia\n"
"\n"
"### Mod Panggilan\n"
"Bercakap secara semula jadi dengan tutor bahasa Inggeris AI dan ikuti "
"transkrip semasa perbualan.\n"
"\n"
"### Mod Pesanan Suara\n"
"Rakam jawapan anda, semak saranan AI, perbaiki respons anda, dan "
"hantarkannya apabila bersedia.\n"
"\n"
"### Mod Chat\n"
"Taip jawapan anda apabila bercakap dengan kuat tidak sesuai.\n"
"\n"
"## Sokongan tambahan semasa perbualan\n"
"\n"
"Anda boleh:\n"
"- laraskan kelajuan pertuturan AI\n"
"- gunakan transkrip untuk mengikuti perbualan\n"
"- dapatkan bantuan apabila anda tidak tahu apa yang hendak dikatakan "
"seterusnya\n"
"\n"
"## Mengapa ia membantu\n"
"\n"
"Semasa anda berlatih, FluencyPal menjejaki kesilapan dan mengubahnya "
"menjadi tugas penambahbaikan yang disasarkan. Ini membantu meningkatkan "
"keyakinan bercakap Bahasa Inggeris, kefasihan, dan ketepatan bercakap anda "
"dari masa ke masa."

#: src/features/Feature/featuresData.ts:275
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"## Read real books while you learn English\n"
"\n"
"FluencyPal Books is a focused reading app for language learners. It is "
"separate from the main practice dashboard so you can stay in the book while "
"you study vocabulary, grammar in context, and listening skills.\n"
"\n"
"Learn more on the [FluencyPal Books landing "
"page](https://book.fluencypal.com/landing).\n"
"\n"
"## What you can do\n"
"\n"
"- upload your own EPUB files, or convert PDF and DOCX\n"
"- click any word for an instant translation, or enable hover translation\n"
"- highlight passages and jump back to them later\n"
"- listen with browser text-to-speech while you read\n"
"- browse free public-domain classics from the Gutenberg library\n"
"- sync your library, highlights, and reading progress across devices\n"
"\n"
"## Why it helps\n"
"\n"
"Reading long-form English connects vocabulary and grammar to real stories "
"and ideas. FluencyPal Books keeps that experience calm and book-first, with "
"learning tools one tap away instead of breaking your flow.\n"
"\n"
"Open the [Books landing page](https://book.fluencypal.com/landing) to try a "
"live demo of the reader and start reading."
msgstr ""
"## Baca buku sebenar semasa anda belajar Bahasa Inggeris\n"
"\n"
"FluencyPal Books ialah aplikasi membaca yang memberi tumpuan kepada "
"pembelajaran bahasa. Ia adalah berasingan daripada papan pemuka amalan "
"utama supaya anda boleh kekal dalam buku semasa anda mempelajari kosa kata, "
"tatabahasa dalam konteks, dan kemahiran mendengar.\n"
"\n"
"Pelajari lebih lanjut di [halaman landing FluencyPal "
"Books](https://book.fluencypal.com/landing).\n"
"\n"
"## Apa yang anda boleh lakukan\n"
"\n"
"- muat naik fail EPUB anda sendiri, atau tukarkan PDF dan DOCX\n"
"- klik mana-mana perkataan untuk terjemahan segera, atau aktifkan "
"terjemahan melayang\n"
"- sorot petikan dan kembali kepada mereka kemudian\n"
"- dengar dengan teks kepada pertuturan pelayar semasa anda membaca\n"
"- layari karya klasik domain awam percuma dari perpustakaan Gutenberg\n"
"- selaras perpustakaan anda, sorotan, dan kemajuan pembacaan merentasi "
"peranti\n"
"\n"
"## Mengapa ia membantu\n"
"\n"
"Membaca teks panjang Bahasa Inggeris menghubungkan kosa kata dan tatabahasa "
"kepada cerita dan idea sebenar. FluencyPal Books mengekalkan pengalaman itu "
"tenang dan mengutamakan buku, dengan alat pembelajaran yang hanya satu "
"ketukan jauh bukannya mengganggu aliran anda.\n"
"\n"
"Buka [halaman landing Books](https://book.fluencypal.com/landing) untuk "
"mencuba demo pembaca langsung dan mula membaca."

#: src/features/Feature/featuresData.ts:381
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"## Structured debate practice with other learners\n"
"\n"
"Debates let you challenge other learners and practice spoken English in a "
"guided format.\n"
"\n"
"## How it works\n"
"\n"
"Both participants:\n"
"- receive the same questions\n"
"- record their answers\n"
"- submit responses to the system\n"
"\n"
"After that, FluencyPal selects a winner, explains the reasoning, and awards "
"points.\n"
"\n"
"## Why it helps\n"
"\n"
"This format makes speaking with other people less stressful while still "
"helping you improve:\n"
"- clarity\n"
"- structure\n"
"- argumentation\n"
"- confidence in spoken English"
msgstr ""
"## Latihan perbahasan berstruktur dengan pelajar lain\n"
"\n"
"Perbahasan membolehkan anda mencabar pelajar lain dan berlatih Bahasa "
"Inggeris lisan dalam format yang dipandu.\n"
"\n"
"## Cara ia berfungsi\n"
"\n"
"Kedua-dua peserta:\n"
"- menerima soalan yang sama\n"
"- merakam jawapan mereka\n"
"- menyerahkan respons kepada sistem\n"
"\n"
"Selepas itu, FluencyPal akan memilih pemenang, menerangkan alasan, dan "
"memberikan mata.\n"
"\n"
"## Mengapa ia membantu\n"
"\n"
"Format ini menjadikan bercakap dengan orang lain kurang tekanan sambil "
"tetap membantu anda meningkatkan:\n"
"- kejelasan\n"
"- struktur\n"
"- perdebatan\n"
"- keyakinan dalam Bahasa Inggeris lisan"

#: src/features/Feature/featuresData.ts:24
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"## What it does\n"
"\n"
"FluencyPal starts with a guided survey that helps create your personalized "
"English learning plan. This is not a marketing form. It is a practical step "
"that helps the AI understand your goal, your current level, and the areas "
"where you need the most support.\n"
"\n"
"## How it works\n"
"\n"
"You describe:\n"
"- what you want to achieve\n"
"- where you feel confident\n"
"- where you struggle\n"
"- what kind of English practice you need most\n"
"\n"
"Based on your answers, the AI asks follow-up questions and builds a plan "
"around your real goal.\n"
"\n"
"## Why it helps\n"
"\n"
"Your plan is not static. As you keep practicing, FluencyPal updates it to "
"reflect your progress, new weak points, and changing priorities.\n"
"\n"
"This makes your English conversation practice more focused, more practical, "
"and easier to apply in real conversations."
msgstr ""
"## Apa yang ia lakukan\n"
"\n"
"FluencyPal bermula dengan tinjauan berpandu yang membantu mencipta pelan "
"pembelajaran Bahasa Inggeris peribadi anda. Ini bukan borang pemasaran. Ia "
"merupakan langkah praktikal yang membantu AI memahami matlamat anda, tahap "
"semasa anda, dan bidang di mana anda memerlukan sokongan yang paling "
"banyak.\n"
"\n"
"## Bagaimana ia berfungsi\n"
"\n"
"Anda menerangkan:\n"
"- apa yang anda ingin capai\n"
"- di mana anda merasa yakin\n"
"- di mana anda berjuang\n"
"- jenis latihan Bahasa Inggeris yang paling anda perlukan\n"
"\n"
"Berdasarkan jawapan anda, AI akan bertanya soalan susulan dan membina pelan "
"yang sepadan dengan matlamat sebenar anda.\n"
"\n"
"## Kenapa ia membantu\n"
"\n"
"Pelan anda tidak statik. Sambil anda terus berlatih, FluencyPal "
"mengemaskininya untuk mencerminkan kemajuan anda, titik lemah baru, dan "
"keutamaan yang berubah.\n"
"\n"
"Ini menjadikan latihan perbualan Bahasa Inggeris anda lebih fokus, lebih "
"praktikal, dan lebih mudah untuk diaplikasikan dalam perbualan sebenar."

#: src/features/Blog/blogData.tsx:362
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"**Introduction**  \n"
"Interviewing in a second language can feel daunting—especially when your "
"dream job is on the line. For intermediate English speakers, the pressure "
"to articulate skills and experiences clearly adds an extra layer of "
"challenge. But here’s the good news: *“With the right preparation, you can "
"turn a challenging interview into an opportunity to shine.”*  \n"
"\n"
"This guide is tailored for **Business English learners** aiming to excel in "
"interviews. Whether you’re applying for roles in tech, marketing, or "
"finance, follow these seven strategic steps to showcase your expertise with "
"confidence. Let’s dive in!  \n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"### **Step 1: Research the Company and Role Thoroughly**  \n"
"Start by studying the company’s website, mission statement, and job "
"description—**in English**. This helps you:  \n"
"- Identify industry-specific terms (e.g., *“KPIs,” “ROI,” “agile "
"development”*).  \n"
"- Align your answers with the company’s values.  \n"
"\n"
"**Pro Tip:** Jot down keywords from the job posting (e.g., "
"*“cross-functional collaboration”*) and weave them into your responses. "
"This shows you speak the company’s language—literally!  \n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"### **Step 2: Craft a Winning Self-Introduction**  \n"
"The “Tell me about yourself” question is your chance to make a stellar "
"first impression. Keep it concise (1–2 minutes) and structured:  \n"
"> *“I’m [Name], a [Job Title] with X years of experience in [Industry]. "
"Recently, I [Key Achievement]. I’m excited about this role because "
"[Alignment with Company Goals].”*  \n"
"\n"
"Practice until it feels natural—avoid sounding robotic!  \n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"### **Step 3: Master Common Interview Questions**  \n"
"Prepare answers for these frequent questions:  \n"
"- *“What are your strengths?”*  \n"
"- *“Why do you want to work here?”*  \n"
"- *“Describe a challenge you overcame.”*  \n"
"\n"
"**Avoid memorizing scripts.** Instead, outline bullet points. For example:  "
"\n"
"> *Strength: Adaptable. Example: “I quickly learned new CRM software during "
"a team transition, improving workflow by 30%.”*  \n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"### **Step 4: Boost Your Business English Vocabulary**  \n"
"Fluency in industry jargon is key. Use platforms like **PREPLY.COM** to "
"learn 5–10 role-specific terms. For a marketing role, master phrases like:  "
"\n"
"- *“Conversion funnel optimization”*  \n"
"- *“Customer retention metrics”*  \n"
"\n"
"Sprinkle these into answers to demonstrate professionalism.  \n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"### **Step 5: Polish Pronunciation and Clarity**  \n"
"Even perfect grammar won’t help if you’re misunderstood. Focus on:  \n"
"- **Ending consonants** (e.g., pronounce the *“t”* in *“project”*).  \n"
"- **Intonation** (rise for questions, fall for statements).  \n"
"\n"
"**Try This:** Record yourself answering questions and note areas to "
"improve.  \n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"### **Step 6: Simulate the Experience with Mock Interviews**  \n"
"Practice builds confidence. Partner with a friend, tutor, or use tools like "
"**FluencyPal** for AI-powered mock interviews. Real-time practice helps:  \n"
"- Reduce anxiety.  \n"
"- Identify tricky questions (e.g., *“Where do you see yourself in 5 "
"years?”*).  \n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"### **Step 7: Prepare Questions + Final Touches**  \n"
"End strong with thoughtful questions:  \n"
"- *“What does success look like in this role?”*  \n"
"- *“How does the team collaborate on projects?”*  \n"
"\n"
"**Final Checklist:**  \n"
"- Lay out professional attire.  \n"
"- Plan your route to arrive early.  \n"
"- Practice polite phrases: *“Thank you for your time—it was a pleasure "
"meeting you.”*  \n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"**Conclusion**  \n"
"As an intermediate English speaker, your preparation is your superpower. By "
"researching, practicing, and refining your Business English skills, you’ll "
"walk into that interview ready to impress.  \n"
"\n"
"**Ready to Test Your Skills?**  \n"
"Simulate the real experience with a **free mock interview on "
"FluencyPal**—your final step to acing the big day!  \n"
msgstr ""
"**Pengenalan**  \n"
"Ditemuduga dalam bahasa kedua boleh terasa menakutkan—terlebih lagi apabila "
"pekerjaan impian anda dipertaruhkan. Bagi penutur bahasa Inggeris "
"sederhana, tekanan untuk melafazkan kemahiran dan pengalaman dengan jelas "
"menambahkan lapisan cabaran tambahan. Tetapi berita baik: *\"Dengan "
"persiapan yang tepat, anda boleh mengubah cabaran temuduga menjadi peluang "
"untuk bersinar.\"*  \n"
"\n"
"Panduan ini dipesan khusus untuk **pelajar Bahasa Inggeris Perniagaan** "
"yang berharap untuk cemerlang dalam temu duga. Sama ada anda sedang memohon "
"jawatan dalam bidang teknologi, pemasaran, atau kewangan, ikuti ketujuh "
"langkah strategik ini untuk menunjukkan kepakaran anda dengan penuh "
"keyakinan. Mari kita mulakan!  \n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"### **Langkah 1: Kaji Syarikat dan Peranan Secara Menyeluruh**  \n"
"Mulakan dengan mempelajari laman web syarikat, kenyataan misi, dan "
"deskripsi kerja—**dalam Bahasa Inggeris**. Ini membantu anda:  \n"
"- Mengenal pasti istilah tertentu khusus industri (misalnya, *\"KPIs,\" "
"\"ROI,\" \"pembangunan agil\"*).  \n"
"- Menyelaraskan jawapan anda dengan nilai syarikat.  \n"
"\n"
"**Tips Pro:** Catat kata kunci dari iklan kerja (misalnya, *\"kolaborasi "
"silang fungsi\"*) dan sertakan dalam jawapan anda. Ini menunjukkan bahawa "
"anda bercakap bahasa syarikat—secara harfiah!  \n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"### **Langkah 2: Buatlah Pengenalan Diri yang Menang**  \n"
"Soalan \"Ceritakan tentang diri anda\" adalah peluang anda untuk membuat "
"kesan pertama yang hebat. Ringkas (1-2 minit) dan terstruktur:  \n"
">*\"Saya [Nama], seorang [Jawatan] dengan pengalaman X tahun dalam "
"[Industri]. Baru-baru ini, saya [Pencapaian Utama]. Saya bersemangat "
"tentang peranan ini kerana [Penyelarasan dengan Matlamat Syarikat].\"*  \n"
"\n"
"Berlatih sampai ianya terasa semula jadi—elakkan kedengaran seperti robot!  "
"\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"### **Langkah 3: Kuasai Soalan Temu duga yang Biasa**  \n"
"Sediakan jawapan bagi soalan yang kerap ditanya ini:  \n"
"- *\"Apa kelebihan anda?\"*  \n"
"- *\"Kenapa anda mahu bekerja di sini?\"*  \n"
"- *\"Ceritakan bagaimana anda mengatasi cabaran.\"*  \n"
"\n"
"**Elakkan penghafalan skrip.** Sebaliknya, susun poin bullet. Sebagai "
"contoh:  \n"
"> *Kelebihan: Penyesuaian. Contoh: \"Saya dengan cepat belajar perisian CRM "
"yang baru semasa peralihan pasukan, meningkatkan aliran kerja sebanyak "
"30%.\"*  \n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"### **Langkah 4: Tingkatkan Kosakata Bahasa Inggeris Perniagaan Anda**  \n"
"Kelancaran dalam jargon industri adalah kunci. Gunakan platform seperti "
"**PREPLY.COM** untuk belajar 5–10 istilah khusus peranan. Untuk peranan "
"dalam pemasaran, kuasai frasa seperti:  \n"
"- *\"Optimisasi corong konversi\"*  \n"
"- *\"Metrik pengekalan pelanggan\"*  \n"
"\n"
"Taburkan ini ke dalam jawapan untuk menunjukkan profesionalisme.  \n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"### **Langkah 5: Pulihkan Sebutan dan Kejelasan**  \n"
"Bahasa Inggeris yang sempurna bahkan tidak membantu jika anda dianggap "
"salah. Fokus pada:  \n"
"- **Konsonan akhir** (misalnya, sebut *\"t\"* dalam *\"project\"*).  \n"
"- **Intonasi** (naik untuk soalan, jatuh untuk pernyataan).  \n"
"\n"
"**Cuba Ini:** Rakam diri anda menjawab soalan dan catat area yang perlu "
"ditingkatkan.  \n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"### **Langkah 6: Lakukan Simulasi Pengalaman dengan Mock Interviews**  \n"
"Latihan membina keyakinan. Berkolaborasi dengan kawan, tutor, atau gunakan "
"alat seperti **FluencyPal** untuk temu duga simulasi didukung AI. Praktek "
"secara real-time membantu:  \n"
"- Mengurangkan kebimbangan.  \n"
"- Mengenal pasti soalan sukar (misalnya, *\"Di mana anda lihat diri anda "
"dalam 5 tahun?\"*).  \n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"### **Langkah 7: Sediakan Soalan + Sentuhan Akhir**  \n"
"Akhiri dengan kuat menggunakan soalan yang berfikir:  \n"
"- *\"Berjaya dalam peranan ini bermakna seperti apa?\"*  \n"
"- *\"Bagaimana pasukan bekerjasama dalam projekprojek?\"*  \n"
"\n"
"**Semak Semula Akhir:**  \n"
"- Susun pakaian profesional anda.  \n"
"- Rancang perjalanan anda untuk sampai lebih awal.  \n"
"- Berlatih frasa sopan: *\"Terima kasih untuk waktu anda—saya gembira "
"bertemu dengan anda.\"*  \n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"**Kesimpulan**  \n"
"Sebagai penutur bahasa Inggeris sederhana, persiapan anda adalah superkuasa "
"anda. Dengan melakukan penyelidikan, latihan, dan memperbaiki kemahiran "
"Bahasa Inggeris Perniagaan anda, anda akan memasuki temu duga tersebut siap "
"untuk membuat kesan.  \n"
"\n"
"**Sedia untuk Menguji Kemahiran Anda?**  \n"
"Lakukan simulasi pengalaman sebenar dengan **temuduga simulasi percuma di "
"FluencyPal** — langkah terakhir anda untuk lulus dengan jayanya pada hari "
"besar tersebut!  \n"

