#: src/features/Blog/blogData.tsx:89
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"Another example from the book describes interrogation. We tend to believe "
"that pressure extracts truth: ask again, intensify the question, apply "
"emotional force. Surely persistence will break resistance.\n"
"\n"
"But pressure might produce compliance. Under stress, people can say what "
"they believe the interrogator wants to hear.\n"
"\n"
"Something similar can happen in conversations with AI. If a question "
"contains its own preferred answer, the system may adapt to its structure. "
"It may align. It may agree too readily. It does not resist pressure in the "
"human sense - and it does not signal strain. There is no visible friction.\n"
"\n"
"The conversation can shift from careful reasoning to comfortable "
"confirmation without us noticing the moment it happened.\n"
"\n"
"Because the system offers no visible signs of discomfort.\n"
"\n"
"AI is becoming part of our daily lives. It helps us think, write, and "
"decide. It sits quietly in the background of work and conversation. It "
"grows more sophisticated each year. There are many signs that we will "
"further integrate it into our lives.\n"
"\n"
"We may be less skilled at reading strangers than we believe. We are prone "
"to overconfidence, to social reassurance. And when the stranger speaks "
"calmly and confidently, our skepticism softens.\n"
"\n"
"The stranger is still in my house.\n"
"\n"
"He is helpful, efficient and polite.\n"
"\n"
"And I am starting to see where a significant risk may lie: in the quiet "
"second when doubt disappears.\n"
msgstr ""
"Satu lagi contoh dari buku tersebut menggambarkan interogasi. Kita "
"cenderung percaya bahawa tekanan mengekstrak kebenaran: tanya lagi, "
"intensifkan soalan, aplikasikan tekanan emosi. Sudah pasti ketekunan akan "
"memecahkan rintangan.\n"
"\n"
"Namun tekanan mungkin menghasilkan kepatuhan. Di bawah tekanan, orang boleh "
"mengatakan apa yang mereka percaya si penyoal mahu dengar.\n"
"\n"
"Sesuatu yang serupa boleh berlaku dalam perbualan dengan AI. Jika soalan "
"mengandungi jawapan pilihannya sendiri, sistem mungkin menyesuaikan diri "
"dengan strukturnya. Ia mungkin seiring. Ia mungkin bersetuju terlalu cepat. "
"Ia tidak menahan tekanan dalam erti kata manusia - dan ia tidak memberi "
"isyarat ketegangan. Tiada geseran yang kelihatan.\n"
"\n"
"Perbualan boleh beralih dari penalaran yang teliti kepada pengesahan yang "
"selesa tanpa kita menyedari saat itu berlaku.\n"
"\n"
"Kerana sistem itu tidak menawarkan tanda-tanda ketidakselesaan yang "
"kelihatan.\n"
"\n"
"AI menjadi sebahagian daripada kehidupan harian kita. Ia membantu kita "
"berfikir, menulis, dan membuat keputusan. Ia duduk dengan senyap di latar "
"belakang kerja dan perbualan. Ia menjadi lebih canggih setiap tahun. "
"Terdapat banyak tanda bahawa kita akan mengintegrasikan lebih lanjut ke "
"dalam kehidupan kita.\n"
"\n"
"Kita mungkin kurang mahir membaca orang asing daripada yang kita percaya. "
"Kita terdedah kepada keyakinan berlebihan, kepada reasurans sosial. Dan "
"apabila orang asing itu bercakap dengan tenang dan yakin, skeptisisme kita "
"melembut.\n"
"\n"
"Orang asing itu masih berada di rumah saya.\n"
"\n"
"Dia membantu, cekap dan sopan.\n"
"\n"
"Dan saya mula melihat di mana risiko besar mungkin terletak: dalam saat "
"yang sunyi apabila keraguan hilang."

