#: src/features/RolePlay/scenarios/making-a-doctors-appointment.ts:16
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"Booking a doctor’s appointment usually involves a short conversation with a "
"receptionist. You may need to provide your name, explain the general reason "
"for the visit, choose an available time, and confirm practical details such "
"as the location and required documents.\n"
"\n"
"You do not need to describe your complete medical history to the "
"receptionist. A brief and clear explanation is usually enough to help them "
"choose the correct appointment type.\n"
"\n"
"This roleplay is for language practice only. It does not provide medical "
"diagnosis or treatment advice. If you believe you are experiencing a "
"medical emergency, contact your local emergency service instead of waiting "
"for a routine appointment.\n"
"\n"
"## Start the Call\n"
"\n"
"You can begin with:\n"
"\n"
"- “Hello, I’d like to make an appointment.”\n"
"- “I’m calling to book an appointment with a doctor.”\n"
"- “I’d like to schedule a medical consultation.”\n"
"- “I need to make an appointment for my child.”\n"
"- “I’d like to arrange a follow-up appointment.”\n"
"- “I was asked to call and schedule another visit.”\n"
"\n"
"The receptionist may ask:\n"
"\n"
"- “Are you already a patient at this clinic?”\n"
"- “May I have your name?”\n"
"- “What is your date of birth?”\n"
"- “Which doctor would you like to see?”\n"
"- “What is the reason for the appointment?”\n"
"- “When are you available?”\n"
"\n"
"## Provide Your Personal Details\n"
"\n"
"The receptionist may need information to find or create your patient "
"record.\n"
"\n"
"You may be asked for:\n"
"\n"
"- Your full name\n"
"- Your date of birth\n"
"- Your telephone number\n"
"- Your address\n"
"- Your patient or insurance number\n"
"- Your email address\n"
"- The name of your regular doctor\n"
"\n"
"Useful phrases include:\n"
"\n"
"- “My name is Alex Dmowski.”\n"
"- “My date of birth is the twelfth of May, nineteen ninety.”\n"
"- “I’m already registered at the clinic.”\n"
"- “This will be my first appointment here.”\n"
"- “Could you check whether my details are already in the system?”\n"
"- “My phone number has recently changed.”\n"
"- “Could I spell my surname for you?”\n"
"\n"
"When spelling information over the phone, you can say:\n"
"\n"
"> “That’s D as in Delta, M as in Mike…”\n"
"\n"
"To confirm numbers:\n"
"\n"
"- “That is one-five, not five-zero.”\n"
"- “Let me repeat the number.”\n"
"- “Did you get the complete phone number?”\n"
"- “Could you read that back to me?”\n"
"\n"
"## Explain the Reason for the Appointment\n"
"\n"
"The receptionist usually needs a short description to determine the "
"appropriate doctor, appointment type, and urgency.\n"
"\n"
"You can say:\n"
"\n"
"- “I’ve had a cough for several days.”\n"
"- “I have been experiencing back pain.”\n"
"- “I’d like to discuss a recurring headache.”\n"
"- “I need a routine check-up.”\n"
"- “I need to renew a prescription.”\n"
"- “I’d like to discuss some test results.”\n"
"- “I need a follow-up after my previous appointment.”\n"
"- “I have a skin problem that I would like a doctor to examine.”\n"
"- “I need a medical certificate.”\n"
"- “I’d like to ask about a vaccination.”\n"
"- “I’m calling about a problem that started yesterday.”\n"
"\n"
"A useful structure is:\n"
"\n"
"> “I’ve been experiencing [general symptom or problem] for [length of "
"time], and I’d like to see a doctor.”\n"
"\n"
"For example:\n"
"\n"
"> “I’ve been experiencing pain in my shoulder for about a week, and it is "
"not improving.”\n"
"\n"
"You do not need to give intimate or highly detailed information to the "
"receptionist. You can say:\n"
"\n"
"- “It’s a private medical issue.”\n"
"- “I would prefer to discuss the details directly with the doctor.”\n"
"- “Could you note that it concerns a personal health matter?”\n"
"- “Is a general description enough for the booking?”\n"
"\n"
"## Explain How Urgent It Is\n"
"\n"
"The receptionist may ask whether the problem is urgent.\n"
"\n"
"Useful phrases include:\n"
"\n"
"- “It is not an emergency, but I would like to be seen soon.”\n"
"- “The symptoms are getting worse.”\n"
"- “I’m in significant discomfort.”\n"
"- “I’m concerned because the problem has continued for several days.”\n"
"- “A doctor asked me to arrange an urgent follow-up.”\n"
"- “I think a routine appointment is sufficient.”\n"
"- “I’m not sure how urgent it is.”\n"
"- “Could a nurse call me to discuss whether I need an earlier appointment?”\n"
"\n"
"The receptionist may offer:\n"
"\n"
"- A routine appointment\n"
"- A same-day appointment\n"
"- An urgent appointment\n"
"- A telephone consultation\n"
"- A video consultation\n"
"- A nurse consultation\n"
"- An appointment with another available doctor\n"
"\n"
"The receptionist is not always qualified to diagnose the problem. Their "
"role is usually to collect enough information to direct you to the "
"appropriate service.\n"
"\n"
"## Understand Emergency Instructions\n"
"\n"
"A medical office may tell you to contact emergency services instead of "
"waiting for an appointment if your symptoms appear immediately dangerous.\n"
"\n"
"During a real call, follow the clinic’s instructions. Do not rely on a "
"language-learning simulation to decide whether a situation is an emergency.\n"
"\n"
"Useful phrases include:\n"
"\n"
"- “Do you think I should wait for an appointment?”\n"
"- “Should I speak with a nurse first?”\n"
"- “Is there an urgent care service I should contact?”\n"
"- “Could you repeat the emergency instructions?”\n"
"- “Which number should I call?”\n"
"- “Could you tell me the name of the service?”\n"
"\n"
"If you believe there is an immediate danger to someone’s life or safety, "
"contact the local emergency service.\n"
"\n"
"## Choose the Right Appointment Type\n"
"\n"
"Different concerns may require different types of appointments.\n"
"\n"
"Common options include:\n"
"\n"
"- **Routine appointment** — for a non-urgent medical concern\n"
"- **Urgent appointment** — for a problem that needs quicker assessment\n"
"- **Follow-up appointment** — to review progress after an earlier visit\n"
"- **Telephone consultation** — a conversation with a doctor by phone\n"
"- **Video consultation** — an online appointment with video\n"
"- **In-person consultation** — a visit at the clinic\n"
"- **Nurse appointment** — for services such as dressings, injections, or "
"some routine checks\n"
"- **Specialist appointment** — a consultation with a doctor in a specific "
"medical field\n"
"\n"
"Useful questions include:\n"
"\n"
"- “Do I need an in-person appointment?”\n"
"- “Could this be handled by telephone?”\n"
"- “Is a video consultation available?”\n"
"- “Should I book with a doctor or a nurse?”\n"
"- “Do I need a referral to see the specialist?”\n"
"- “Can any doctor help me, or should I see my regular doctor?”\n"
"- “How long is the appointment?”\n"
"- “Is this the correct type of appointment for my issue?”\n"
"\n"
"## Ask for a Specific Doctor\n"
"\n"
"You may want to see your regular doctor or a doctor with a particular "
"specialty.\n"
"\n"
"You can say:\n"
"\n"
"- “I’d prefer to see Dr. Avery.”\n"
"- “Is my regular doctor available?”\n"
"- “I have seen Dr. Avery about this problem before.”\n"
"- “Could I book with a female doctor?”\n"
"- “Could I book with a male doctor?”\n"
"- “Is there a doctor who speaks English?”\n"
"- “I need an appointment with a dermatologist.”\n"
"- “Could I see any available doctor?”\n"
"- “I’m happy to see another doctor if I can get an earlier appointment.”\n"
"\n"
"The receptionist may respond:\n"
"\n"
"- “Your regular doctor is not available this week.”\n"
"- “Another doctor can see you tomorrow.”\n"
"- “The earliest appointment with Dr. Avery is next Tuesday.”\n"
"- “You will need a referral before seeing that specialist.”\n"
"\n"
"## State Your Availability\n"
"\n"
"Be specific about the dates and times that work for you.\n"
"\n"
"Useful phrases include:\n"
"\n"
"- “I’m available on Monday afternoon.”\n"
"- “I can come any morning this week.”\n"
"- “Do you have anything after five?”\n"
"- “I’m not available before three.”\n"
"- “Could I come during my lunch break?”\n"
"- “I would prefer the earliest available appointment.”\n"
"- “Is there anything available today?”\n"
"- “Do you have an appointment tomorrow morning?”\n"
"- “I can be flexible with the time.”\n"
"- “I’m available every day except Thursday.”\n"
"\n"
"The receptionist may offer:\n"
"\n"
"> “We have an appointment on Wednesday at 10:20 or Friday at 3:45.”\n"
"\n"
"You can respond:\n"
"\n"
"- “Wednesday at 10:20 works for me.”\n"
"- “Could you check whether anything earlier is available?”\n"
"- “Friday would be better.”\n"
"- “Unfortunately, I’ll be at work then.”\n"
"- “Do you have anything later in the day?”\n"
"- “I’ll take the earliest option.”\n"
"\n"
"## Confirm Dates and Times Carefully\n"
"\n"
"Dates and times can be difficult to understand over the phone. Always "
"confirm them.\n"
"\n"
"Useful phrases include:\n"
"\n"
"- “Did you say Tuesday the fourteenth?”\n"
"- “Was that 9:15 or 9:50?”\n"
"- “Could you repeat the time slowly?”\n"
"- “So the appointment is on Friday at half past two, correct?”\n"
"- “Could you use the twenty-four-hour time?”\n"
"- “Is that appointment in the morning or the afternoon?”\n"
"- “Could you send me a confirmation message?”\n"
"\n"
"It is useful to repeat the final details:\n"
"\n"
"> “Let me confirm: Tuesday, July fourteenth, at 3:30 with Dr. Avery.”\n"
"\n"
"## Ask About the Location\n"
"\n"
"Some clinics operate in more than one building or location.\n"
"\n"
"You can ask:\n"
"\n"
"- “Which clinic is the appointment at?”\n"
"- “Could you give me the address?”\n"
"- “Which floor should I go to?”\n"
"- “Which reception desk should I use?”\n"
"- “Is the entrance accessible?”\n"
"- “Is there parking nearby?”\n"
"- “How early should I arrive?”\n"
"- “Where should I check in?”\n"
"- “Is the appointment at the main clinic or the specialist centre?”\n"
"\n"
"## Ask What to Bring\n"
"\n"
"Depending on the appointment, you may need to bring documents, medication "
"information, or test results.\n"
"\n"
"Useful questions include:\n"
"\n"
"- “What should I bring with me?”\n"
"- “Do I need identification?”\n"
"- “Should I bring my insurance card?”\n"
"- “Do I need a referral?”\n"
"- “Should I bring my previous test results?”\n"
"- “Do I need a list of my current medications?”\n"
"- “Should I prepare anything before the appointment?”\n"
"- “Do I need to avoid eating before the visit?”\n"
"- “Will you send the instructions by email?”\n"
"\n"
"Do not fast, stop medication, or change treatment based only on "
"assumptions. Ask the clinic for specific instructions.\n"
"\n"
"## Ask About Costs and Insurance\n"
"\n"
"You may need to confirm whether the appointment is covered or requires "
"payment.\n"
"\n"
"Useful questions include:\n"
"\n"
"- “Is this appointment covered by my insurance?”\n"
"- “Do you accept my insurance provider?”\n"
"- “Is there a consultation fee?”\n"
"- “How much will the appointment cost?”\n"
"- “Do I need to pay in advance?”\n"
"- “Can I pay by card?”\n"
"- “Will I receive an invoice?”\n"
"- “Do I need authorization from my insurance company?”\n"
"- “Is there a fee if I cancel?”\n"
"\n"
"The receptionist may need your insurance or patient number to check "
"coverage.\n"
"\n"
"## Request Language Assistance\n"
"\n"
"If you are not confident speaking the local language, ask whether language "
"support is available.\n"
"\n"
"You can say:\n"
"\n"
"- “Do you have a doctor who speaks English?”\n"
"- “Is an interpreter available?”\n"
"- “Can I bring someone to help me translate?”\n"
"- “Could the appointment be conducted in English?”\n"
"- “Could you speak a little more slowly, please?”\n"
"- “I understand some Polish, but I may need help with medical vocabulary.”\n"
"- “Could you send the important information in writing?”\n"
"\n"
"Ask in advance whether another person is allowed to join the appointment.\n"
"\n"
"## Ask for Accessibility Support\n"
"\n"
"You can inform the clinic about any accessibility needs when making the "
"appointment.\n"
"\n"
"Useful phrases include:\n"
"\n"
"- “I use a wheelchair. Is the clinic accessible?”\n"
"- “I need step-free access.”\n"
"- “I have difficulty hearing over the phone.”\n"
"- “Could the doctor communicate with me in writing?”\n"
"- “I need additional time for the appointment.”\n"
"- “Can someone help me enter the building?”\n"
"- “Is there an accessible toilet?”\n"
"- “Could you note my accessibility needs on the appointment?”\n"
"\n"
"## Book an Appointment for Someone Else\n"
"\n"
"You may be arranging an appointment for a child, family member, or someone "
"you support.\n"
"\n"
"You can say:\n"
"\n"
"- “I’m calling to make an appointment for my son.”\n"
"- “I’m arranging the appointment for my mother.”\n"
"- “The patient’s name is…”\n"
"- “I have permission to arrange the appointment.”\n"
"- “Does the patient need to speak with you directly?”\n"
"- “Do you need their consent?”\n"
"- “Can I attend the appointment with them?”\n"
"\n"
"Privacy rules may limit what the clinic can discuss without the patient’s "
"consent.\n"
"\n"
"## Reschedule an Appointment\n"
"\n"
"If you cannot attend, contact the clinic as early as possible.\n"
"\n"
"Useful phrases include:\n"
"\n"
"- “I need to reschedule my appointment.”\n"
"- “I’m no longer available at that time.”\n"
"- “Could I move the appointment to another day?”\n"
"- “Do you have anything available next week?”\n"
"- “Could I change it to a telephone consultation?”\n"
"- “I would like to keep the same doctor.”\n"
"- “What is the earliest alternative appointment?”\n"
"\n"
"You may need to provide:\n"
"\n"
"- Your full name\n"
"- Your date of birth\n"
"- The original appointment date\n"
"- The doctor’s name\n"
"- Your patient or booking number\n"
"\n"
"## Cancel an Appointment\n"
"\n"
"To cancel, say:\n"
"\n"
"- “I need to cancel my appointment.”\n"
"- “I will not be able to attend.”\n"
"- “The appointment is on Monday at two.”\n"
"- “Could you confirm that it has been cancelled?”\n"
"- “Is there a cancellation fee?”\n"
"- “Do I need to book another appointment now?”\n"
"- “Could you send me a cancellation confirmation?”\n"
"\n"
"Cancelling early may allow another patient to use the appointment.\n"
"\n"
"## Join a Cancellation List\n"
"\n"
"If no suitable appointment is available, ask whether the clinic has a "
"waiting or cancellation list.\n"
"\n"
"Useful phrases include:\n"
"\n"
"- “Could you add me to the cancellation list?”\n"
"- “Please contact me if an earlier appointment becomes available.”\n"
"- “I can come at short notice.”\n"
"- “How will you contact me?”\n"
"- “How quickly would I need to respond?”\n"
"- “Could you keep my current appointment while I wait for an earlier one?”\n"
"\n"
"## Handle an Unavailable Appointment\n"
"\n"
"The receptionist may say:\n"
"\n"
"- “There are no appointments available today.”\n"
"- “The doctor is fully booked.”\n"
"- “The next available appointment is in two weeks.”\n"
"- “Your regular doctor is currently away.”\n"
"- “We only have telephone appointments available.”\n"
"\n"
"You can respond:\n"
"\n"
"- “Is another doctor available?”\n"
"- “Could I speak with a nurse?”\n"
"- “Is there another clinic I can contact?”\n"
"- “Could you add me to the cancellation list?”\n"
"- “What should I do if the symptoms get worse?”\n"
"- “Is there an urgent care service?”\n"
"- “Could I have a telephone consultation first?”\n"
"\n"
"## Confirm the Appointment\n"
"\n"
"Before ending the call, confirm:\n"
"\n"
"- The patient’s name\n"
"- The doctor or healthcare professional\n"
"- The date\n"
"- The time\n"
"- The appointment type\n"
"- The location or call method\n"
"- Anything you need to bring\n"
"- Any preparation instructions\n"
"- The cancellation policy\n"
"\n"
"You can say:\n"
"\n"
"- “Could we confirm all the details?”\n"
"- “Who will I be seeing?”\n"
"- “Is this an in-person or telephone appointment?”\n"
"- “Will the doctor call me, or should I call the clinic?”\n"
"- “Which number will the doctor use?”\n"
"- “Should I arrive early?”\n"
"- “Will I receive a text or email confirmation?”\n"
"- “What should I do if I need to cancel?”\n"
"\n"
"## A Simple Appointment Conversation\n"
"\n"
"A typical conversation may look like this:\n"
"\n"
"> **Receptionist:** Good morning. Dr. Avery’s office. How can I help?  \n"
"> **Patient:** Hello, I’d like to make an appointment, please.  \n"
"> **Receptionist:** Certainly. Are you already registered with the clinic?  "
"\n"
"> **Patient:** Yes. My name is Alex Dmowski.  \n"
"> **Receptionist:** Thank you. What is the general reason for the "
"appointment?  \n"
"> **Patient:** I’ve had pain in my shoulder for about a week, and it is not "
"improving.  \n"
"> **Receptionist:** Would you like an in-person appointment?  \n"
"> **Patient:** Yes, please. Do you have anything available this week?  \n"
"> **Receptionist:** We have Thursday at 11:20 or Friday at 4:10.  \n"
"> **Patient:** Friday at 4:10 would be better.  \n"
"> **Receptionist:** That will be with Dr. Avery at our Central Clinic.  \n"
"> **Patient:** Great. Should I bring anything with me?  \n"
"> **Receptionist:** Please bring identification and a list of any "
"medication you currently take.  \n"
"> **Patient:** Let me confirm: Friday at 4:10 at the Central Clinic with "
"Dr. Avery.  \n"
"> **Receptionist:** That’s correct.\n"
"\n"
"## A Simple Appointment Formula\n"
"\n"
"Follow this structure when booking:\n"
"\n"
"1. **Request:** Say that you want to make an appointment.\n"
"2. **Identify yourself:** Give the required personal details.\n"
"3. **Explain briefly:** State the general reason for the visit.\n"
"4. **Discuss urgency:** Explain whether the issue is routine or needs "
"quicker attention.\n"
"5. **Choose a time:** State your availability and select an appointment.\n"
"6. **Ask practical questions:** Confirm the location, appointment type, "
"costs, and required documents.\n"
"7. **Repeat the details:** Confirm the date, time, doctor, and next steps.\n"
"\n"
"For example:\n"
"\n"
"> “I’d like to make an appointment about recurring headaches. It is not an "
"emergency, but I would like to see a doctor this week. I’m available after "
"three on Wednesday or Friday.”\n"
"\n"
"## Practice Scenario\n"
"\n"
"In this roleplay, you are calling Dr. Avery’s office to arrange a medical "
"appointment. The AI receptionist will ask for your details, the general "
"reason for the visit, and your availability.\n"
"\n"
"During the conversation, try to:\n"
"\n"
"- State that you would like to make an appointment.\n"
"- Provide your name and any requested patient details.\n"
"- Briefly explain the reason for the visit.\n"
"- Say whether the problem is routine or needs quicker attention.\n"
"- Ask about in-person, telephone, or video appointment options.\n"
"- Compare at least two available times.\n"
"- Ask what documents or information you should bring.\n"
"- Confirm the appointment date, time, doctor, location, and next steps.\n"
"\n"
"Focus on communicating the necessary information clearly. You do not need "
"to describe private medical details or use advanced medical vocabulary."
msgstr ""
"Menempah temujanji doktor biasanya melibatkan perbualan ringkas dengan "
"penyambut tetamu. Anda mungkin perlu memberikan nama anda, menerangkan "
"sebab umum untuk lawatan tersebut, memilih masa yang tersedia, dan "
"mengesahkan butiran praktikal seperti lokasi dan dokumen yang diperlukan.\n"
"\n"
"Anda tidak perlu menerangkan sejarah perubatan lengkap anda kepada "
"penyambut tetamu. Penjelasan ringkas dan jelas biasanya mencukupi untuk "
"membantu mereka memilih jenis temujanji yang betul.\n"
"\n"
"Mainkan peranan ini hanya untuk latihan bahasa. Ia tidak menyediakan "
"diagnosis perubatan atau nasihat rawatan. Jika anda percaya anda mengalami "
"kecemasan perubatan, hubungi perkhidmatan kecemasan tempatan anda daripada "
"menunggu untuk temujanji rutin.\n"
"\n"
"## Mulakan Panggilan\n"
"\n"
"Anda boleh mulakan dengan:\n"
"\n"
"- “Hello, saya ingin membuat temujanji.”\n"
"- “Saya menelefon untuk menempah temujanji dengan doktor.”\n"
"- “Saya ingin menjadualkan konsultasi perubatan.”\n"
"- “Saya perlu membuat temujanji untuk anak saya.”\n"
"- “Saya ingin mengatur temujanji susulan.”\n"
"- “Saya diminta menelefon dan menjadualkan lawatan lain.”\n"
"\n"
"Penyambut tetamu mungkin bertanya:\n"
"\n"
"- “Adakah anda sudah menjadi pesakit di klinik ini?”\n"
"- “Bolehkah saya mengetahui nama anda?”\n"
"- “Apakah tarikh lahir anda?”\n"
"- “Doktor mana yang anda ingin jumpa?”\n"
"- “Apakah sebab temujanji ini?”\n"
"- “Bila anda ada masa?”\n"
"\n"
"## Berikan Butiran Peribadi Anda\n"
"\n"
"Penyambut tetamu mungkin memerlukan maklumat untuk mencari atau mencipta "
"rekod pesakit anda.\n"
"\n"
"Anda mungkin diminta untuk memberikan:\n"
"\n"
"- Nama penuh anda\n"
"- Tarikh lahir anda\n"
"- Nombor telefon anda\n"
"- Alamat anda\n"
"- Nombor pesakit atau insurans anda\n"
"- Alamat e-mel anda\n"
"- Nama doktor tetap anda\n"
"\n"
"Frasa berguna termasuk:\n"
"\n"
"- “Nama saya Alex Dmowski.”\n"
"- “Tarikh lahir saya ialah dua belas Mei, sembilan belas sembilan puluh.”\n"
"- “Saya sudah berdaftar di klinik ini.”\n"
"- “Ini adalah temujanji pertama saya di sini.”\n"
"- “Bolehkah anda memeriksa sama ada butiran saya sudah ada dalam sistem?”\n"
"- “Nombor telefon saya telah berubah baru-baru ini.”\n"
"- “Bolehkah saya mengeja nama belakang saya untuk anda?”\n"
"\n"
"Apabila mengeja maklumat melalui telefon, anda boleh katakan:\n"
"\n"
"> “Itu ialah D sebagai Delta, M sebagai Mike…”\n"
"\n"
"Untuk mengesahkan nombor:\n"
"\n"
"- “Itu satu-lima, bukan lima-kosong.”\n"
"- “Biar saya ulangi nombornya.”\n"
"- “Adakah anda dapat nombor telefon lengkap tersebut?”\n"
"- “Bolehkah anda baca semula kepada saya?”\n"
"\n"
"## Terangkan Sebab Temujanji\n"
"\n"
"Penyambut tetamu biasanya memerlukan penerangan ringkas untuk menentukan "
"doktor yang sesuai, jenis temujanji, dan tahap kepentingan.\n"
"\n"
"Anda boleh katakan:\n"
"\n"
"- “Saya batuk selama beberapa hari.”\n"
"- “Saya telah mengalami sakit belakang.”\n"
"- “Saya ingin membincangkan sakit kepala yang berulang.”\n"
"- “Saya perlu pemeriksaan rutin.”\n"
"- “Saya perlu memperbaharui preskripsi.”\n"
"- “Saya ingin membincangkan beberapa keputusan ujian.”\n"
"- “Saya memerlukan susulan selepas temujanji saya sebelum ini.”\n"
"- “Saya mempunyai masalah kulit yang saya ingin seorang doktor periksa.”\n"
"- “Saya perlukan sijil perubatan.”\n"
"- “Saya ingin bertanya tentang vaksinasi.”\n"
"- “Saya menelefon mengenai masalah yang bermula semalam.”\n"
"\n"
"Struktur yang berguna ialah:\n"
"\n"
"> \"Saya telah mengalami [simptom atau masalah umum] selama [tempoh masa], "
"dan saya ingin berjumpa doktor.\"\n"
"\n"
"Sebagai contoh:\n"
"\n"
"> \"Saya telah mengalami sakit di bahu saya selama kira-kira seminggu, dan "
"ia tidak membaik.\"\n"
"\n"
"Anda tidak perlu memberikan maklumat intim atau terperinci tinggi kepada "
"penyambut tetamu. Anda boleh katakan:\n"
"\n"
"- “Ia adalah isu perubatan peribadi.”\n"
"- “Saya lebih suka membincangkan butiran secara langsung dengan doktor.”\n"
"- “Bolehkah anda catat bahawa ia berkaitan dengan masalah kesihatan "
"peribadi?”\n"
"- “Adakah penerangan umum cukup untuk tempahan?”\n"
"\n"
"## Terangkan Kepentingan Keadaan\n"
"\n"
"Penyambut tetamu mungkin bertanya sama ada masalah itu penting.\n"
"\n"
"Frasa berguna termasuk:\n"
"\n"
"- “Ia bukan kecemasan, tetapi saya ingin dilihat segera.”\n"
"- “Simptom semakin buruk.”\n"
"- “Saya dalam ketidakselesaan yang sewajarnya.”\n"
"- “Saya bimbang kerana masalah ini sudah berterusan selama beberapa hari.”\n"
"- “Doktor meminta saya untuk mengatur susulan mendesak.”\n"
"- “Saya rasa temujanji rutin sudah mencukupi.”\n"
"- “Saya tidak pasti seberapa pentingnya ia.”\n"
"- “Bolehkah jururawat menelefon saya untuk membincangkan sama ada saya "
"memerlukan temujanji lebih awal?”\n"
"\n"
"Penyambut tetamu mungkin menawarkan:\n"
"\n"
"- Temujanji rutin\n"
"- Temujanji hari yang sama\n"
"- Temujanji segera\n"
"- Konsultasi telefon\n"
"- Konsultasi video\n"
"- Konsultasi jururawat\n"
"- Temujanji dengan doktor lain yang ada\n"
"\n"
"Penyambut tetamu tidak selalu layak untuk mendiagnosis masalah. Tugas "
"mereka biasanya untuk mengumpulkan maklumat yang mencukupi untuk "
"mengarahkan anda ke perkhidmatan yang sesuai.\n"
"\n"
"## Fahami Arahan Kecemasan\n"
"\n"
"Pejabat perubatan mungkin memberitahu anda untuk menghubungi perkhidmatan "
"kecemasan dan bukannya menunggu temujanji jika simptom anda kelihatan "
"segera berbahaya.\n"
"\n"
"Semasa panggilan sebenar, ikuti arahan klinik. Jangan bergantung pada "
"simulasi pembelajaran bahasa untuk memutuskan sama ada keadaan tersebut "
"adalah kecemasan.\n"
"\n"
"Frasa berguna termasuk:\n"
"\n"
"- “Adakah anda fikir saya patut tunggu temujanji?”\n"
"- “Patutkah saya bercakap dengan jururawat terlebih dahulu?”\n"
"- “Adakah terdapat perkhidmatan rawatan segera yang patut saya hubungi?”\n"
"- “Bolehkah anda ulang arahan kecemasan?”\n"
"- “Nombor mana yang patut saya panggil?”\n"
"- “Bolehkah anda memberitahu saya nama perkhidmatan?”\n"
"\n"
"Jika anda percaya terdapat bahaya segera kepada nyawa atau keselamatan "
"seseorang, hubungi perkhidmatan kecemasan tempatan.\n"
"\n"
"## Pilih Jenis Temujanji Yang Betul\n"
"\n"
"Kebimbangan berbeza mungkin memerlukan jenis temujanji yang berbeza.\n"
"\n"
"Pilihan biasa termasuk:\n"
"\n"
"- **Temujanji rutin** — untuk kebimbangan perubatan yang tidak mendesak\n"
"- **Temujanji mendesak** — untuk masalah yang memerlukan penilaian lebih "
"cepat\n"
"- **Temujanji susulan** — untuk menyemak kemajuan selepas lawatan terdahulu\n"
"- **Konsultasi telefon** — perbualan dengan doktor melalui telefon\n"
"- **Konsultasi video** — temujanji dalam talian dengan video\n"
"- **Konsultasi secara peribadi** — lawatan di klinik\n"
"- **Temujanji jururawat** — untuk perkhidmatan seperti pembalutan, "
"suntikan, atau beberapa pemeriksaan rutin\n"
"- **Temujanji pakar** — konsultasi dengan doktor dalam bidang perubatan "
"tertentu\n"
"\n"
"Soalan berguna termasuk:\n"
"\n"
"- “Adakah saya memerlukan temujanji secara peribadi?”\n"
"- “Bolehkah ini diuruskan melalui telefon?”\n"
"- “Adakah konsultasi video tersedia?”\n"
"- “Patutkah saya menempah dengan doktor atau jururawat?”\n"
"- “Adakah saya perlukan rujukan untuk berjumpa pakar?”\n"
"- “Bolehkah mana-mana doktor membantu saya, atau saya patut berjumpa doktor "
"tetap saya?”\n"
"- “Berapa lamakah temujanji itu?”\n"
"- “Adakah ini jenis temujanji yang betul untuk masalah saya?”\n"
"\n"
"## Mohon Doktor Tertentu\n"
"\n"
"Anda mungkin mahu berjumpa doktor tetap anda atau doktor dengan kepakaran "
"tertentu.\n"
"\n"
"Anda boleh katakan:\n"
"\n"
"- “Saya lebih suka berjumpa Dr. Avery.”\n"
"- “Adakah doktor tetap saya tersedia?”\n"
"- “Saya pernah berjumpa Dr. Avery tentang masalah ini sebelum ini.”\n"
"- “Bolehkah saya ditempah dengan doktor wanita?”\n"
"- “Bolehkah saya ditempah dengan doktor lelaki?”\n"
"- “Adakah terdapat doktor yang boleh berbahasa Inggeris?”\n"
"- “Saya perlukan temujanji dengan pakar dermatologi.”\n"
"- “Bolehkah saya berjumpa mana-mana doktor yang ada?”\n"
"- “Saya gembira berjumpa doktor lain jika saya boleh dapatkan temujanji "
"lebih awal.”\n"
"\n"
"Penyambut tetamu mungkin menjawab:\n"
"\n"
"- “Doktor tetap anda tidak tersedia minggu ini.”\n"
"- “Doktor lain boleh berjumpa anda esok.”\n"
"- “Temujanji terawal dengan Dr. Avery adalah Selasa depan.”\n"
"- “Anda perlu rujukan sebelum berjumpa pakar itu.”\n"
"\n"
"## Nyatakan Ketersediaan Anda\n"
"\n"
"Jelaskan tentang tarikh dan masa yang sesuai untuk anda.\n"
"\n"
"Frasa berguna termasuk:\n"
"\n"
"- “Saya tersedia pada petang Isnin.”\n"
"- “Saya boleh datang bila-bila pagi minggu ini.”\n"
"- “Adakah anda ada apa-apa selepas lima?”\n"
"- “Saya tidak tersedia sebelum tiga.”\n"
"- “Bolehkah saya datang semasa rehat tengahari saya?”\n"
"- “Saya lebih suka temujanji terawal yang tersedia.”\n"
"- “Adakah ada apa-apa yang tersedia hari ini?”\n"
"- “Adakah anda ada temujanji pagi esok?”\n"
"- “Saya boleh fleksibel dengan masa.”\n"
"- “Saya tersedia setiap hari kecuali Khamis.”\n"
"\n"
"Penyambut tetamu mungkin menawarkan:\n"
"\n"
"> “Kami ada temujanji pada Rabu jam 10:20 atau Jumaat jam 3:45.”\n"
"\n"
"Anda boleh jawab:\n"
"\n"
"- “Rabu jam 10:20 sesuai untuk saya.”\n"
"- “Bolehkah anda periksa jika ada apa-apa lebih awal?”\n"
"- “Jumaat lebih baik.”\n"
"- “Sayangnya, saya akan bekerja masa itu.”\n"
"- “Adakah anda ada apa-apa lebih lewat pada hari tersebut?”\n"
"- “Saya akan ambil pilihan terawal.”\n"
"\n"
"## Sahkan Tarikh dan Masa Secara Teliti\n"
"\n"
"Tarikh dan masa boleh sukar difahami melalui telefon. Sentiasa sahkannya.\n"
"\n"
"Frasa berguna termasuk:\n"
"\n"
"- “Adakah anda kata Selasa yang keempat belas?”\n"
"- “Itu 9:15 atau 9:50?”\n"
"- “Bolehkah anda ulang masa secara perlahan?”\n"
"- “Jadi temujanji ialah pada Jumaat jam dua setengah, betul?”\n"
"- “Bolehkah anda gunakan masa dua puluh empat jam?”\n"
"- “Adakah temujanji itu pada waktu pagi atau petang?”\n"
"- “Bolehkah anda hantar mesej pengesahan kepada saya?”\n"
"\n"
"Adalah berguna untuk mengulangi butiran akhir:\n"
"\n"
"> “Biar saya sahkan: Selasa, empat belas Julai, jam 3:30 dengan Dr. Avery.”\n"
"\n"
"## Tanyakan Tentang Lokasi\n"
"\n"
"Sesetengah klinik beroperasi di lebih daripada satu bangunan atau lokasi.\n"
"\n"
"Anda boleh tanya:\n"
"\n"
"- “Klinik mana temujanji ini diadakan?”\n"
"- “Bolehkah anda beri saya alamat?”\n"
"- “Tingkat mana saya perlu pergi?”\n"
"- “Meja penerimaan mana saya patut gunakan?”\n"
"- “Adakah pintu masuk boleh diakses?”\n"
"- “Adakah ada tempat letak kereta berdekatan?”\n"
"- “Berapa awal saya patut tiba?”\n"
"- “Di mana saya harus mendaftar masuk?”\n"
"- “Adakah temujanji di klinik utama atau pusat pakar?”\n"
"\n"
"## Tanyakan Apa yang Perlu Dibawa\n"
"\n"
"Bergantung pada temujanji, anda mungkin perlu membawa dokumen, maklumat "
"ubat, atau keputusan ujian.\n"
"\n"
"Soalan berguna termasuk:\n"
"\n"
"- “Apa yang patut saya bawa bersama saya?”\n"
"- “Adakah saya perlukan pengenalan?”\n"
"- “Patutkah saya bawa kad insurans?”\n"
"- “Perlukah saya bawa keputusan ujian lepas?”\n"
"- “Patutkah saya bawa senarai ubat semasa saya?”\n"
"- “Patutkah saya bersedia apa-apa sebelum temujanji?”\n"
"- “Patutkah saya elak makan sebelum lawatan?”\n"
"- “Adakah anda akan hantar arahan melalui e-mel?”\n"
"\n"
"Jangan berpuasa, berhenti ubat, atau ubah rawatan hanya berdasarkan "
"anggapan. Tanyakan klinik untuk arahan spesifik.\n"
"\n"
"## Tanyakan Mengenai Kos dan Insurans\n"
"\n"
"Anda mungkin perlu mengesahkan sama ada temujanji ditanggung atau "
"memerlukan bayaran.\n"
"\n"
"Soalan berguna termasuk:\n"
"\n"
"- “Adakah temujanji ini ditanggung oleh insurans saya?”\n"
"- “Adakah anda terima penyedia insurans saya?”\n"
"- “Adakah terdapat yuran konsultasi?”\n"
"- “Berapa kos temujanji ini?”\n"
"- “Perlukah saya membayar lebih awal?”\n"
"- “Bolehkah saya bayar dengan kad?”\n"
"- “Adakah saya akan menerima invois?”\n"
"- “Perlukah saya dapatkan kebenaran daripada syarikat insurans?”\n"
"- “Adakah terdapat yuran jika saya batalkan?”\n"
"\n"
"Penyambut tetamu mungkin memerlukan nombor insurans atau pesakit anda untuk "
"memeriksa liputan.\n"
"\n"
"## Minta Bantuan Bahasa\n"
"\n"
"Jika anda tidak yakin bercakap dalam bahasa tempatan, tanyakan sama ada "
"sokongan bahasa ada.\n"
"\n"
"Anda boleh katakan:\n"
"\n"
"- “Adakah anda mempunyai doktor yang bercakap Inggeris?”\n"
"- “Adakah jurubahasa tersedia?”\n"
"- “Bolehkah saya bawa seseorang untuk membantu saya menterjemah?”\n"
"- “Bolehkah temujanji dijalankan dalam bahasa Inggeris?”\n"
"- “Bolehkah anda bercakap lebih perlahan sedikit?”\n"
"- “Saya memahami sedikit bahasa Poland, tetapi mungkin perlu bantuan dengan "
"kosa kata perubatan.”\n"
"- “Bolehkah anda hantar maklumat penting secara bertulis?”\n"
"\n"
"Tanya lebih awal sama ada orang lain dibenarkan untuk menyertai temujanji.\n"
"\n"
"## Minta Sokongan Kebolehcapaian\n"
"\n"
"Anda boleh memaklumkan klinik tentang sebarang keperluan kebolehcapaian "
"semasa membuat temujanji.\n"
"\n"
"Frasa berguna termasuk:\n"
"\n"
"- “Saya gunakan kerusi roda. Adakah klinik boleh diakses?”\n"
"- “Saya perlukan akses tanpa tangga.”\n"
"- “Saya mengalami kesukaran mendengar melalui telefon.”\n"
"- “Bolehkah doktor berkomunikasi dengan saya secara bertulis?”\n"
"- “Saya perlukan masa tambahan untuk temujanji.”\n"
"- “Bolehkah seseorang membantu saya masuk ke dalam bangunan?”\n"
"- “Adakah tandas boleh diakses?”\n"
"- “Bolehkah anda catat keperluan kebolehcapaian saya pada temujanji?”\n"
"\n"
"## Tempah Temujanji Untuk Orang Lain\n"
"\n"
"Anda mungkin mengaturkan temujanji untuk anak, ahli keluarga, atau "
"seseorang yang anda sokong.\n"
"\n"
"Anda boleh katakan:\n"
"\n"
"- “Saya menelefon untuk membuat temujanji untuk anak lelaki saya.”\n"
"- “Saya mengatur temujanji untuk ibu saya.”\n"
"- “Nama pesakit ialah…”\n"
"- “Saya mempunyai kebenaran untuk mengatur temujanji.”\n"
"- “Adakah pesakit perlu bercakap dengan anda secara langsung?”\n"
"- “Adakah anda perlukan kebenaran mereka?”\n"
"- “Bolehkah saya menghadiri temujanji bersama mereka?”\n"
"\n"
"Peraturan privasi mungkin mengehadkan apa yang boleh dibincangkan klinik "
"tanpa kebenaran pesakit.\n"
"\n"
"## Jadualkan Semula Temujanji\n"
"\n"
"Jika anda tidak dapat hadir, hubungi klinik secepat mungkin.\n"
"\n"
"Frasa berguna termasuk:\n"
"\n"
"- “Saya perlu menjadualkan semula temujanji saya.”\n"
"- “Saya tidak lagi tersedia pada masa itu.”\n"
"- “Bolehkah saya pindahkan temujanji ke hari lain?”\n"
"- “Adakah anda punya apa-apa yang tersedia minggu depan?”\n"
"- “Bolehkah saya mengubahnya kepada konsultasi telefon?\n"
"- “Saya ingin mengekalkan doktor yang sama.”\n"
"- “Apa temujanji alternatif terawal?”\n"
"\n"
"Anda mungkin perlu memberikan:\n"
"\n"
"- Nama penuh anda\n"
"- Tarikh lahir anda\n"
"- Tarikh temujanji asal\n"
"- Nama doktor\n"
"- Nombor pesakit atau tempahan anda\n"
"\n"
"## Batalkan Temujanji\n"
"\n"
"Untuk membatalkan, katakan:\n"
"\n"
"- “Saya perlu membatalkan temujanji saya.”\n"
"- \"Saya tidak dapat hadir.\n"
"- “Temujanji adalah pada hari Isnin jam dua.”\n"
"- “Bolehkah anda sahkan bahawa ia telah dibatalkan?”\n"
"- “Adakah terdapat yuran pembatalan?”\n"
"- “Perlukah saya tempah temujanji lain sekarang?”\n"
"- “Bolehkah anda hantar pengesahan pembatalan kepada saya?”\n"
"\n"
"Pembatalan awal boleh membenarkan pesakit lain menggunakan temujanji "
"tersebut.\n"
"\n"
"## Sertai Senarai Pembatalan\n"
"\n"
"Jika tiada temujanji yang sesuai tersedia, tanyakan sama ada klinik "
"mempunyai senarai menunggu atau pembatalan.\n"
"\n"
"Frasa berguna termasuk:\n"
"\n"
"- “Bolehkah anda tambah saya ke senarai pembatalan?”\n"
"- “Sila hubungi saya jika temujanji lebih awal tersedia.”\n"
"- “Saya boleh datang jika mendapat notis singkat.”\n"
"- “Bagaimana anda akan menghubungi saya?”\n"
"- “Berapa cepat saya perlu jawab?”\n"
"- “Bolehkah anda simpan temujanji semasa saya sementara saya menunggu "
"temujanji lebih awal?”\n"
"\n"
"## Tangani Temujanji Yang Tidak Tersedia\n"
"\n"
"Penyambut tetamu mungkin berkata:\n"
"\n"
"- “Tiada temujanji yang tersedia hari ini.”\n"
"- “Doktor sudah penuh.”\n"
"- “Temujanji terawal seterusnya adalah dalam dua minggu.”\n"
"- “Doktor tetap anda sedang tiada.”\n"
"- “Kami hanya mempunyai temujanji melalui telefon.”\n"
"\n"
"Anda boleh jawab:\n"
"\n"
"- “Adakah doktor lain tersedia?”\n"
"- “Bolehkah saya bercakap dengan jururawat?”\n"
"- “Adakah terdapat klinik lain yang boleh saya hubungi?”\n"
"- “Bolehkah anda tambah saya ke senarai pembatalan?”\n"
"- “Apa yang patut saya lakukan jika simptom bertambah buruk?”\n"
"- “Adakah terdapat perkhidmatan rawatan segera?”\n"
"- “Bolehkah saya mempunyai konsultasi telefon dahulu?”\n"
"\n"
"## Sahkan Temujanji\n"
"\n"
"Sebelum mengakhiri panggilan, sahkan:\n"
"\n"
"- Nama pesakit\n"
"- Doktor atau profesional kesihatan\n"
"- Tarikh\n"
"- Masa\n"
"- Jenis temujanji\n"
"- Lokasi atau kaedah panggilan\n"
"- Apa yang perlu anda bawa\n"
"- Sebarang arahan persediaan\n"
"- Polisi pembatalan\n"
"\n"
"Anda boleh katakan:\n"
"\n"
"- “Bolehkah kami sahkan semua butiran?”\n"
"- “Siapa yang akan saya jumpa?”\n"
"- “Adakah ini temujanji secara peribadi atau telefon?”\n"
"- “Adakah doktor akan menelefon saya, atau saya patut hubungi klinik?”\n"
"- “Nombor mana yang akan digunakan oleh doktor?”\n"
"- “Patutkah saya tiba awal?”\n"
"- “Adakah saya akan menerima pesanan teks atau e-mel pengesahan?”\n"
"- “Apa yang patut saya lakukan jika saya perlu membatalkan?”\n"
"\n"
"## Perbualan Temujanji Mudah\n"
"\n"
"Perbualan tipikal mungkin kelihatan seperti ini:\n"
"\n"
"> **Penyambut Tetamu:** Selamat pagi. Pejabat Dr. Avery. Boleh saya bantu?  "
"\n"
"> **Pesakit:** Hello, saya ingin membuat temujanji, sila.  \n"
"> **Penyambut Tetamu:** Sudah tentu. Adakah anda sudah berdaftar dengan "
"klinik?  \n"
"> **Pesakit:** Ya. Nama saya Alex Dmowski.  \n"
"> **Penyambut Tetamu:** Terima kasih. Apakah sebab umum untuk temujanji "
"ini?  \n"
"> **Pesakit:** Saya telah sakit di bahu saya selama kira-kira seminggu, dan "
"ia tidak membaik.  \n"
"> **Penyambut Tetamu:** Adakah anda ingin temujanji secara peribadi?  \n"
"> **Pesakit:** Ya, sila. Adakah anda ada apa-apa yang tersedia minggu ini?  "
"\n"
"> **Penyambut Tetamu:** Kami ada Khamis jam 11:20 atau Jumaat jam 4:10.  \n"
"> **Pesakit:** Jumaat jam 4:10 lebih baik.  \n"
"> **Penyambut Tetamu:** Itu adalah dengan Dr. Avery di Klinik Pusat kami.  \n"
"> **Pesakit:** Bagus. Patutkah saya bawa apa-apa bersama saya?  \n"
"> **Penyambut Tetamu:** Sila bawa pengenalan diri dan senarai sebarang ubat "
"yang anda ambil sekarang.  \n"
"> **Pesakit:** Biar saya sahkan: Jumaat jam 4:10 di Klinik Pusat dengan Dr. "
"Avery.  \n"
"> **Penyambut Tetamu:** Betul.\n"
"\n"
"## Formula Temujanji Mudah\n"
"\n"
"Ikuti struktur ini semasa menempah:\n"
"\n"
"1. **Permohonan:** Katakan bahawa anda ingin membuat temujanji.\n"
"2. **Kenalkan diri:** Beri butiran peribadi yang diperlukan.\n"
"3. **Terangkan secara ringkas:** Nyatakan sebab umum untuk lawatan.\n"
"4. **Bincangkan kepentingan:** Terangkan sama ada isu itu adalah rutin atau "
"memerlukan perhatian lebih cepat.\n"
"5. **Pilih masa:** Nyatakan ketersediaan anda dan pilih temujanji.\n"
"6. **Tanya soalan praktikal:** Sahkan lokasi, jenis temujanji, kos, dan "
"dokumen yang diperlukan.\n"
"7. **Ulangi butiran:** Sahkan tarikh, masa, doktor, dan langkah seterusnya.\n"
"\n"
"Sebagai contoh:\n"
"\n"
"> “Saya ingin membuat temujanji tentang sakit kepala yang berulang. Ini "
"bukan kecemasan, tetapi saya ingin berjumpa doktor minggu ini. Saya "
"tersedia selepas tiga pada hari Rabu atau Jumaat.”\n"
"\n"
"## Senario Latihan\n"
"\n"
"Dalam lakonan peranan ini, anda menelefon pejabat Dr. Avery untuk mengatur "
"temujanji perubatan. Penyambut tetamu AI akan meminta butiran anda, sebab "
"umum untuk lawatan, dan ketersediaan anda.\n"
"\n"
"Semasa perbualan, cuba:\n"
"\n"
"- Nyatakan bahawa anda ingin membuat temujanji.\n"
"- Berikan nama anda dan sebarang butiran pesakit yang diminta.\n"
"- Terangkan secara ringkas sebab lawatan.\n"
"- Katakan sama ada masalah itu adalah rutin atau memerlukan perhatian lebih "
"cepat.\n"
"- Tanyakan tentang opsyen temujanji secara peribadi, telefon, atau video.\n"
"- Bandingkan sekurang-kurangnya dua masa yang tersedia.\n"
"- Tanyakan dokumen atau maklumat apa yang perlu anda bawa.\n"
"- Sahkan tarikh temujanji, masa, doktor, lokasi, dan langkah seterusnya.\n"
"\n"
"Fokus pada menyampaikan maklumat yang diperlukan dengan jelas. Anda tidak "
"perlu menerangkan butiran perubatan peribadi atau menggunakan kosa kata "
"perubatan yang maju."

