#: src/features/RolePlay/scenarios/calling-technical-support.ts:16
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"Calling technical support can be stressful, especially when you need to "
"explain a complicated problem in another language. A good support "
"conversation is usually structured: describe the problem, answer a few "
"questions, try one solution at a time, and confirm whether anything has "
"changed.\n"
"\n"
"You do not need to know advanced technical vocabulary. Clear descriptions "
"and specific examples are more useful than complicated language.\n"
"\n"
"## Prepare Before You Call\n"
"\n"
"Before contacting support, collect the information that may help the agent "
"understand the issue:\n"
"\n"
"- The type of device you are using\n"
"- The device model, if you know it\n"
"- The name of the app, website, or service\n"
"- The operating system or software version\n"
"- The exact error message\n"
"- When the problem started\n"
"- What you were doing when it happened\n"
"- What troubleshooting steps you have already tried\n"
"- Your account or ticket number, if relevant\n"
"\n"
"You can say:\n"
"\n"
"- “I’m calling about a problem with my laptop.”\n"
"- “I’m having trouble with your mobile app.”\n"
"- “The problem started this morning.”\n"
"- “It was working normally yesterday.”\n"
"- “I have already restarted the device.”\n"
"- “I can see an error message on the screen.”\n"
"\n"
"## Start the Conversation\n"
"\n"
"A support agent may begin by asking:\n"
"\n"
"- “How can I help you today?”\n"
"- “Could you describe the problem?”\n"
"- “Which device are you using?”\n"
"- “When did the issue begin?”\n"
"- “Are you seeing an error message?”\n"
"- “Have you tried any troubleshooting steps?”\n"
"- “May I have your account or reference number?”\n"
"\n"
"A clear opening description might be:\n"
"\n"
"> “I’m having trouble connecting my laptop to Wi-Fi. It can see the "
"network, but it cannot connect. The problem started about an hour ago.”\n"
"\n"
"Another example:\n"
"\n"
"> “The application closes every time I try to upload a file. I updated it "
"yesterday, and the issue started after the update.”\n"
"\n"
"## Describe the Problem Clearly\n"
"\n"
"A useful problem description answers four questions:\n"
"\n"
"1. **What are you using?**\n"
"2. **What are you trying to do?**\n"
"3. **What happens instead?**\n"
"4. **When did the problem begin?**\n"
"\n"
"Use this pattern:\n"
"\n"
"> “I’m using [device or service]. I’m trying to [action], but [problem]. It "
"started [time].”\n"
"\n"
"For example:\n"
"\n"
"> “I’m using the desktop version of the application. I’m trying to sign in, "
"but the page keeps loading and never opens. It started this morning.”\n"
"\n"
"Useful phrases include:\n"
"\n"
"- “The screen is completely blank.”\n"
"- “The application keeps crashing.”\n"
"- “The device will not turn on.”\n"
"- “The internet connection keeps dropping.”\n"
"- “I cannot log in to my account.”\n"
"- “The page is loading very slowly.”\n"
"- “The sound is not working.”\n"
"- “My microphone is not being detected.”\n"
"- “The file will not upload.”\n"
"- “The payment did not go through.”\n"
"- “The device is frozen.”\n"
"- “The button does not respond.”\n"
"- “It works sometimes, but not consistently.”\n"
"\n"
"## Explain What You Expected\n"
"\n"
"It can help to compare the actual result with the expected result.\n"
"\n"
"For example:\n"
"\n"
"- “Normally, the dashboard appears after I log in.”\n"
"- “I expected the file to upload, but nothing happened.”\n"
"- “The headphones should connect automatically.”\n"
"- “The confirmation email usually arrives immediately.”\n"
"- “The camera works in other applications, but not in this one.”\n"
"\n"
"A useful structure is:\n"
"\n"
"> “Normally, [expected result], but now [actual result].”\n"
"\n"
"For example:\n"
"\n"
"> “Normally, the application opens in a few seconds, but now it closes "
"immediately.”\n"
"\n"
"## Report an Error Message\n"
"\n"
"If you see an error, read it exactly or describe it as accurately as "
"possible.\n"
"\n"
"You can say:\n"
"\n"
"- “The message says, ‘Connection failed.’”\n"
"- “I’m getting error code 403.”\n"
"- “A pop-up says that I do not have permission.”\n"
"- “The screen says the account cannot be found.”\n"
"- “I don’t remember the exact wording.”\n"
"- “Could I spell the error message for you?”\n"
"- “I can send you a screenshot if that would help.”\n"
"\n"
"To make sure the agent understands a code or number, say:\n"
"\n"
"- “That is four-zero-three.”\n"
"- “The reference number is A as in Alpha, B as in Bravo, seven-two.”\n"
"- “Let me repeat that.”\n"
"- “Did you get the whole number?”\n"
"\n"
"## Explain When and How Often It Happens\n"
"\n"
"The agent may need to know whether the issue happens every time or only "
"under certain conditions.\n"
"\n"
"Useful phrases include:\n"
"\n"
"- “It happens every time.”\n"
"- “It only happens occasionally.”\n"
"- “It happens after a few minutes.”\n"
"- “It started after the latest update.”\n"
"- “It only happens when I use Wi-Fi.”\n"
"- “It works on my phone, but not on my laptop.”\n"
"- “It happens with every file.”\n"
"- “It only happens with large files.”\n"
"- “The problem disappears after I restart the app.”\n"
"- “I can reproduce the problem.”\n"
"\n"
"You may be asked:\n"
"\n"
"- “Can you reproduce the issue?”\n"
"- “Does it happen on another device?”\n"
"- “Does it happen with a different browser?”\n"
"- “Is anyone else experiencing the same problem?”\n"
"- “Did anything change before the problem started?”\n"
"\n"
"## Explain What You Have Already Tried\n"
"\n"
"Tell the support agent what you have done so that you do not repeat "
"unnecessary steps.\n"
"\n"
"You can say:\n"
"\n"
"- “I have already restarted the device.”\n"
"- “I tried turning the Wi-Fi off and on.”\n"
"- “I updated the application.”\n"
"- “I reinstalled the software.”\n"
"- “I tried another browser.”\n"
"- “I cleared the browser cache.”\n"
"- “I checked the cables.”\n"
"- “I reset my password.”\n"
"- “I tried using another account.”\n"
"- “None of those steps solved the problem.”\n"
"\n"
"You can also describe the result:\n"
"\n"
"- “Restarting helped temporarily.”\n"
"- “The error message changed after the update.”\n"
"- “It worked once, but the problem came back.”\n"
"- “There was no difference.”\n"
"- “Now I can log in, but the page is still very slow.”\n"
"\n"
"## Follow Troubleshooting Instructions\n"
"\n"
"The support agent may ask you to perform several steps.\n"
"\n"
"Common instructions include:\n"
"\n"
"- “Please restart the device.”\n"
"- “Open the settings menu.”\n"
"- “Select ‘Network and Internet.’”\n"
"- “Turn Bluetooth off and back on.”\n"
"- “Disconnect and reconnect the cable.”\n"
"- “Check whether an update is available.”\n"
"- “Try signing in again.”\n"
"- “Open the app in another browser.”\n"
"- “Please clear the cache.”\n"
"- “Uninstall and reinstall the application.”\n"
"- “Check whether the app has permission to use your microphone.”\n"
"\n"
"After each instruction, explain what you see:\n"
"\n"
"- “I’ve opened the settings.”\n"
"- “I can see that option.”\n"
"- “I don’t see that button.”\n"
"- “The menu looks different on my device.”\n"
"- “It is asking for a password.”\n"
"- “The device is restarting now.”\n"
"- “I’ve completed that step.”\n"
"- “The same error is still appearing.”\n"
"- “It seems to be working now.”\n"
"\n"
"## Ask the Agent to Slow Down or Clarify\n"
"\n"
"It is normal to ask the agent to repeat an instruction, especially during a "
"phone conversation.\n"
"\n"
"Useful phrases include:\n"
"\n"
"- “Could you repeat that, please?”\n"
"- “Could you speak a little more slowly?”\n"
"- “What should I click next?”\n"
"- “Where can I find that setting?”\n"
"- “Did you say ‘restart’ or ‘reset’?”\n"
"- “Could you spell that word?”\n"
"- “Should I close the application first?”\n"
"- “Do you mean the button in the top-right corner?”\n"
"- “Could you guide me through it step by step?”\n"
"- “Please give me a moment to find that option.”\n"
"\n"
"To confirm an instruction, say:\n"
"\n"
"> “So first I close the application, then restart the device. Is that "
"correct?”\n"
"\n"
"This helps prevent mistakes and shows that you are following carefully.\n"
"\n"
"## Understand Common Technical Terms\n"
"\n"
"You may hear these terms during a support call:\n"
"\n"
"- **Restart** — turn a device or application off and on again\n"
"- **Reset** — return a setting or device to an earlier or default state\n"
"- **Update** — install a newer software version\n"
"- **Reinstall** — remove software and install it again\n"
"- **Connection** — the link between a device and a network or service\n"
"- **Browser** — an application used to open websites\n"
"- **Cache** — temporarily stored data that may sometimes cause problems\n"
"- **Account credentials** — information used to access an account\n"
"- **Permissions** — settings that allow an application to use features or "
"data\n"
"- **Backup** — a saved copy of important data\n"
"- **Factory reset** — deleting personal settings and returning a device to "
"its original state\n"
"- **Remote access** — allowing another person or program to control your "
"device\n"
"- **Escalation** — transferring a problem to a more specialized support "
"team\n"
"\n"
"Be careful with the difference between **restart** and **reset**. A reset "
"may change settings or remove data, depending on the type of reset.\n"
"\n"
"## Confirm Before Risky Steps\n"
"\n"
"Some troubleshooting actions may affect your files, settings, or account.\n"
"\n"
"Before continuing, ask:\n"
"\n"
"- “Will this delete any of my data?”\n"
"- “Should I make a backup first?”\n"
"- “Will I need to sign in again?”\n"
"- “Will this reset all my settings?”\n"
"- “Can I undo this step?”\n"
"- “Is there a safer option we can try first?”\n"
"- “Will reinstalling the app remove my saved files?”\n"
"- “Could you explain what this step will change?”\n"
"\n"
"Do not perform a factory reset, delete important files, or remove an "
"account unless you understand the consequences.\n"
"\n"
"## Protect Your Personal Information\n"
"\n"
"A legitimate support agent may need to verify your identity, but you should "
"still protect sensitive information.\n"
"\n"
"Never share:\n"
"\n"
"- Your complete password\n"
"- A one-time verification code unless you initiated and understand the "
"process\n"
"- Your full payment-card details without a legitimate reason\n"
"- Recovery phrases or private cryptocurrency keys\n"
"- Unnecessary personal documents\n"
"- Remote access to your device unless you trust and contacted the company "
"through an official channel\n"
"\n"
"You can say:\n"
"\n"
"- “I’m not comfortable sharing my password.”\n"
"- “Can you verify my identity another way?”\n"
"- “Why do you need that information?”\n"
"- “I contacted you through the official support number.”\n"
"- “I would prefer not to install remote-access software.”\n"
"- “Can you send the instructions through the official support portal?”\n"
"\n"
"A real support agent should not need your account password.\n"
"\n"
"## Test Whether the Solution Worked\n"
"\n"
"After completing a troubleshooting step, test the original action again.\n"
"\n"
"You can say:\n"
"\n"
"- “Let me try opening the application again.”\n"
"- “I’ll test the microphone now.”\n"
"- “The page is loading correctly.”\n"
"- “The error is still there.”\n"
"- “The connection is more stable now.”\n"
"- “It works, but it is still slower than usual.”\n"
"- “The original problem is fixed.”\n"
"- “The problem returned after a few minutes.”\n"
"\n"
"Be specific about what changed:\n"
"\n"
"> “I can now log in, but I still cannot upload files.”\n"
"\n"
"This tells the agent that one part of the issue is resolved while another "
"remains.\n"
"\n"
"## Ask About the Cause\n"
"\n"
"Once the issue is fixed, you may want to understand why it happened and how "
"to prevent it.\n"
"\n"
"Useful questions include:\n"
"\n"
"- “Do you know what caused the problem?”\n"
"- “Was this related to the latest update?”\n"
"- “Is this a known issue?”\n"
"- “Could it happen again?”\n"
"- “Is there anything I should do to prevent it?”\n"
"- “Should I keep this setting enabled?”\n"
"- “Do I need to install another update?”\n"
"- “Where can I check the service status?”\n"
"\n"
"The agent may not know the exact cause immediately, but they may provide a "
"likely explanation or prevention steps.\n"
"\n"
"## Request Escalation or Further Support\n"
"\n"
"Sometimes the first support agent cannot solve the problem.\n"
"\n"
"You can ask:\n"
"\n"
"- “Could you escalate this issue?”\n"
"- “Could I speak with a technical specialist?”\n"
"- “Can you create a support ticket?”\n"
"- “What happens next?”\n"
"- “When should I expect an update?”\n"
"- “How will your team contact me?”\n"
"- “Is there a reference number for this case?”\n"
"- “Do I need to provide any additional information?”\n"
"- “Should I call back if I do not receive a response?”\n"
"\n"
"If the agent creates a ticket, confirm:\n"
"\n"
"- The ticket or case number\n"
"- The next action\n"
"- Who will contact you\n"
"- The expected communication method\n"
"- Whether you need to keep the device available\n"
"\n"
"For example:\n"
"\n"
"> “Could you repeat the ticket number and explain what will happen next?”\n"
"\n"
"## Ask for a Replacement, Refund, or Repair\n"
"\n"
"If troubleshooting cannot solve the problem, the next step may involve a "
"repair, replacement, or refund.\n"
"\n"
"Useful questions include:\n"
"\n"
"- “Is the device still under warranty?”\n"
"- “Can the product be repaired?”\n"
"- “Am I eligible for a replacement?”\n"
"- “Can I request a refund?”\n"
"- “How long will the repair take?”\n"
"- “Do I need to send the device to you?”\n"
"- “Will you provide a shipping label?”\n"
"- “Will I receive a temporary replacement?”\n"
"- “Are there any repair fees?”\n"
"\n"
"You may also need to provide:\n"
"\n"
"- Proof of purchase\n"
"- The serial number\n"
"- The purchase date\n"
"- Photos or videos showing the issue\n"
"- The original packaging\n"
"\n"
"## End the Call Clearly\n"
"\n"
"Before ending the conversation, summarize the result and next steps.\n"
"\n"
"You can say:\n"
"\n"
"- “So the issue is now resolved, correct?”\n"
"- “Let me confirm what I need to do next.”\n"
"- “You will email me within two working days.”\n"
"- “My ticket number is 48271, correct?”\n"
"- “I should contact you again if the problem returns.”\n"
"- “Is there anything else I need to do?”\n"
"- “Thank you for guiding me through the steps.”\n"
"- “Thank you for your help.”\n"
"\n"
"If the issue is unresolved, make sure you know what will happen next.\n"
"\n"
"## A Simple Support Conversation\n"
"\n"
"A typical conversation may look like this:\n"
"\n"
"> **Agent:** Technical Support. How can I help you today?  \n"
"> **Caller:** My laptop cannot connect to my home Wi-Fi. It can see the "
"network, but the connection fails.  \n"
"> **Agent:** When did the problem begin?  \n"
"> **Caller:** About an hour ago. It was working normally this morning.  \n"
"> **Agent:** Have you restarted the laptop and the router?  \n"
"> **Caller:** I restarted the laptop, but not the router. Could you explain "
"how to do that safely?  \n"
"> **Agent:** Certainly. Disconnect the router from power, wait thirty "
"seconds, and reconnect it.  \n"
"> **Caller:** Will that change any of my network settings?  \n"
"> **Agent:** No, it will only restart the router.  \n"
"> **Caller:** All right. I’ve reconnected it. The lights are coming back on "
"now.  \n"
"> **Agent:** Please try connecting your laptop again.  \n"
"> **Caller:** It works now. Do you know what caused the problem?  \n"
"> **Agent:** The router may have temporarily lost its connection.  \n"
"> **Caller:** Understood. Thank you for your help.\n"
"\n"
"## A Simple Support Formula\n"
"\n"
"When contacting technical support, follow this structure:\n"
"\n"
"1. **Identify the product:** Explain which device, application, or service "
"you are using.\n"
"2. **Describe the goal:** Say what you are trying to do.\n"
"3. **Explain the problem:** Describe what happens instead.\n"
"4. **Add context:** Say when it began and whether it happens repeatedly.\n"
"5. **List previous attempts:** Explain what you have already tried.\n"
"6. **Follow one step at a time:** Confirm each instruction before "
"continuing.\n"
"7. **Test the result:** Try the original action again.\n"
"8. **Confirm the outcome:** Ask about the cause, prevention, or next steps.\n"
"\n"
"For example:\n"
"\n"
"> “I’m using your mobile app on an Android phone. I’m trying to log in, but "
"the app closes after I enter my password. The problem started after "
"yesterday’s update, and restarting the phone did not help.”\n"
"\n"
"## Practice Scenario\n"
"\n"
"In this roleplay, you are calling TechEase Support about a technical "
"problem. The AI support agent will ask questions, guide you through "
"troubleshooting steps, and help determine what should happen next.\n"
"\n"
"During the conversation, try to:\n"
"\n"
"- Describe the device or service you are using.\n"
"- Explain what you expected and what happened instead.\n"
"- Say when the issue started.\n"
"- Report an error message or another specific symptom.\n"
"- Explain what you have already tried.\n"
"- Ask the agent to clarify at least one instruction.\n"
"- Confirm whether a troubleshooting step changed anything.\n"
"- Ask for a ticket number or further support if the issue remains "
"unresolved.\n"
"\n"
"Focus on being clear and specific. You do not need advanced technical "
"knowledge or perfect grammar to have a successful support conversation."
msgstr ""
"Memanggil sokongan teknikal boleh menjadi tekanan, terutamanya apabila anda "
"perlu menjelaskan masalah rumit dalam bahasa lain. Perbualan sokongan yang "
"baik biasanya disusun: terangkan masalah, jawab beberapa soalan, cuba satu "
"penyelesaian pada satu masa, dan sahkan sama ada ada yang berubah.\n"
"\n"
"Anda tidak perlu mengetahui perbendaharaan kata teknikal yang maju. Huraian "
"jelas dan contoh khusus lebih berguna daripada bahasa yang rumit.\n"
"\n"
"## Bersedia Sebelum Anda Memanggil\n"
"\n"
"Sebelum menghubungi sokongan, kumpulkan maklumat yang boleh membantu ejen "
"memahami isu tersebut:\n"
"\n"
"- Jenis peranti yang anda gunakan\n"
"- Model peranti, jika anda tahu\n"
"- Nama aplikasi, laman web, atau perkhidmatan\n"
"- Sistem operasi atau versi perisian\n"
"- Mesej ralat yang tepat\n"
"- Bila masalah bermula\n"
"- Apa yang anda lakukan apabila ia berlaku\n"
"- Langkah penyelesaian masalah yang telah anda cuba\n"
"- Nombor akaun atau tiket anda, jika berkaitan\n"
"\n"
"Anda boleh berkata:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Saya memanggil mengenai masalah dengan komputer riba saya.\"\n"
"- \"Saya menghadapi masalah dengan aplikasi mudah alih anda.\"\n"
"- \"Masalah ini bermula pagi tadi.\"\n"
"- \"Ia berfungsi seperti biasa semalam.\"\n"
"- \"Saya telah memulakan semula peranti ini.\"\n"
"- \"Saya boleh melihat mesej ralat di skrin.\"\n"
"\n"
"## Mulakan Perbualan\n"
"\n"
"Ejen sokongan mungkin bermula dengan bertanya:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Bagaimana saya boleh membantu anda hari ini?\"\n"
"- \"Bolehkah anda menerangkan masalah tersebut?\"\n"
"- \"Peranti mana yang anda gunakan?\"\n"
"- \"Bila isu ini bermula?\"\n"
"- \"Adakah anda melihat mesej ralat?\"\n"
"- \"Adakah anda telah mencuba sebarang langkah penyelesaian masalah?\"\n"
"- \"Boleh saya dapatkan nombor akaun atau rujukan anda?\"\n"
"\n"
"Penerangan pembukaan yang jelas mungkin seperti berikut:\n"
"\n"
"> \"Saya menghadapi masalah menyambungkan komputer riba saya kepada Wi-Fi. "
"Ia dapat melihat rangkaian, tetapi tidak dapat menyambung. Masalah ini "
"bermula kira-kira sejam lalu.\"\n"
"\n"
"Contoh lain:\n"
"\n"
"> \"Aplikasi ini menutup setiap kali saya cuba memuat naik fail. Saya telah "
"mengemas kininya semalam, dan masalah itu bermula selepas kemas kini.\"\n"
"\n"
"## Terangkan Masalah dengan Jelas\n"
"\n"
"Penerangan masalah yang berguna menjawab empat soalan:\n"
"\n"
"1. **Apa yang anda gunakan?**\n"
"2. **Apa yang anda cuba lakukan?**\n"
"3. **Apa yang berlaku sebaliknya?**\n"
"4. **Bila masalah ini bermula?**\n"
"\n"
"Gunakan corak ini:\n"
"\n"
"> \"Saya menggunakan [peranti atau perkhidmatan]. Saya cuba untuk "
"[tindakan], tetapi [masalah]. Ia bermula [masa].\"\n"
"\n"
"Sebagai contoh:\n"
"\n"
"> \"Saya menggunakan versi desktop aplikasi ini. Saya cuba untuk log masuk, "
"tetapi halaman terus memuatkan dan tidak pernah dibuka. Ia bermula pagi "
"ini.\"\n"
"\n"
"Ungkapan berguna termasuk:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Skrin sepenuhnya kosong.\"\n"
"- \"Aplikasi ini terus terhempas.\"\n"
"- \"Peranti ini tidak akan hidup.\"\n"
"- \"Sambungan internet sering terputus.\"\n"
"- \"Saya tidak boleh log masuk ke akaun saya.\"\n"
"- \"Halaman memuatkan sangat perlahan.\"\n"
"- \"Bunyi tidak berfungsi.\"\n"
"- \"Mikrofon saya tidak dikesan.\"\n"
"- \"Fail tidak akan dimuat naik.\"\n"
"- \"Pembayaran tidak berjaya.\"\n"
"- \"Peranti ini beku.\"\n"
"- \"Butang tidak bertindak balas.\"\n"
"- \"Ia berfungsi kadangkala, tetapi tidak konsisten.\"\n"
"\n"
"## Terangkan Apa yang Anda Harapkan\n"
"\n"
"Ia boleh membantu untuk membandingkan hasil sebenar dengan hasil yang "
"diharapkan.\n"
"\n"
"Sebagai contoh:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Biasanya, papan pemuka muncul selepas saya log masuk.\"\n"
"- \"Saya mengharapkan fail dimuat naik, tetapi tiada apa yang berlaku.\"\n"
"- \"Headphone sepatutnya bersambung secara automatik.\"\n"
"- \"E-mel pengesahan biasanya tiba dengan segera.\"\n"
"- \"Kamera berfungsi dalam aplikasi lain, tetapi tidak dalam yang ini.\"\n"
"\n"
"Struktur yang berguna ialah:\n"
"\n"
"> \"Biasanya, [hasil yang diharapkan], tetapi sekarang [hasil sebenar].\"\n"
"\n"
"Sebagai contoh:\n"
"\n"
"> \"Biasanya, aplikasi ini dibuka dalam beberapa saat, tetapi sekarang ia "
"terus menutup segera.\"\n"
"\n"
"## Laporkan Mesej Ralat\n"
"\n"
"Jika anda melihat sebarang ralat, bacakan dengan tepat atau huraikan "
"seakurat mungkin.\n"
"\n"
"Anda boleh berkata:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Mesej mengatakan, 'Sambungan gagal.'\"\n"
"- \"Saya mendapat kod ralat 403.\"\n"
"- \"Pop-up mengatakan bahawa saya tidak mempunyai kebenaran.\"\n"
"- \"Skrin mengatakan akaun tidak dapat ditemui.\"\n"
"- \"Saya tidak ingat perkataan yang tepat.\"\n"
"- \"Bolehkah saya mengeja mesej ralat itu untuk anda?\"\n"
"- \"Saya boleh menghantar tangkapan skrin jika itu membantu.\"\n"
"\n"
"Untuk memastikan ejen memahami kod atau nombor, katakan:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Itu adalah empat-sifar-tiga.\"\n"
"- \"Nombor rujukan ialah A seperti Alpha, B seperti Bravo, tujuh-dua.\"\n"
"- \"Biar saya ulangi itu.\"\n"
"- \"Adakah anda mendapat keseluruhan nombor?\"\n"
"\n"
"## Terangkan Bila dan Seberapa Sering Ia Berlaku\n"
"\n"
"Ejen mungkin perlu tahu sama ada isu ini berlaku setiap kali atau hanya di "
"bawah syarat tertentu.\n"
"\n"
"Ungkapan berguna termasuk:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Ia berlaku setiap kali.\"\n"
"- \"Ia hanya berlaku sekali-sekala.\"\n"
"- \"Ia berlaku selepas beberapa minit.\"\n"
"- \"Ia bermula selepas kemas kini terbaru.\"\n"
"- \"Ia hanya berlaku apabila saya gunakan Wi-Fi.\"\n"
"- \"Ia berfungsi di telefon saya, tetapi tidak di komputer riba saya.\"\n"
"- \"Ia berlaku dengan setiap fail.\"\n"
"- \"Ia hanya berlaku dengan fail besar.\"\n"
"- \"Masalah ini hilang selepas saya mulakan semula aplikasi.\"\n"
"- \"Saya boleh menghasilkan semula masalah ini.\"\n"
"\n"
"Anda mungkin akan ditanya:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Boleh anda menghasilkan semula isu ini?\"\n"
"- \"Adakah ia berlaku pada peranti lain?\"\n"
"- \"Adakah ia berlaku dengan pelayar yang berbeza?\"\n"
"- \"Adakah sesiapa lagi mengalami masalah yang sama?\"\n"
"- \"Adakah apa-apa yang berubah sebelum masalah ini bermula?\"\n"
"\n"
"## Terangkan Apa yang Anda Telah Cuba\n"
"\n"
"Beritahu ejen sokongan apa yang telah anda lakukan supaya anda tidak "
"mengulangi langkah yang tidak perlu ini.\n"
"\n"
"Anda boleh berkata:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Saya telah memulakan semula peranti ini.\"\n"
"- \"Saya cuba mematikan dan menghidupkan semula Wi-Fi.\"\n"
"- \"Saya telah mengemas kini aplikasi tersebut.\"\n"
"- \"Saya telah memasang semula perisian.\"\n"
"- \"Saya cuba pelayar lain.\"\n"
"- \"Saya telah membersihkan cache pelayar.\"\n"
"- \"Saya telah memeriksa kabel.\"\n"
"- \"Saya telah menetapkan semula kata laluan saya.\"\n"
"- \"Saya telah mencuba menggunakan akaun lain.\"\n"
"- \"Tiada satu pun daripada langkah itu menyelesaikan masalah ini.\"\n"
"\n"
"Anda boleh juga menerangkan hasilnya:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Memulakan semula membantu buat sementara waktu.\"\n"
"- \"Mesej ralat berubah selepas kemas kini.\"\n"
"- \"Ia berfungsi sekali, tetapi masalah ini muncul kembali.\"\n"
"- \"Tidak ada perbezaan.\"\n"
"- \"Sekarang saya boleh log masuk, tetapi halaman masih sangat perlahan.\"\n"
"\n"
"## Ikuti Arahan Penyelesaian Masalah\n"
"\n"
"Ejen sokongan mungkin meminta anda untuk melakukan beberapa langkah.\n"
"\n"
"Arahan biasa termasuk:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Sila mulakan semula peranti ini.\"\n"
"- \"Buka menu tetapan.\"\n"
"- \"Pilih 'Rangkaian dan Internet.'”\n"
"- \"Matikan dan hidupkan semula Bluetooth.\"\n"
"- \"Nyahpasang dan sambung semula kabel.\"\n"
"- \"Periksa sama ada terdapat kemas kini yang tersedia.\"\n"
"- \"Cuba log masuk sekali lagi.\"\n"
"- \"Buka aplikasi dalam pelayar lain.\"\n"
"- \"Sila bersihkan cache.\"\n"
"- \"Nyahpasang dan pasang semula aplikasi itu.\"\n"
"- \"Periksa sama ada aplikasi mempunyai keizinan untuk menggunakan mikrofon "
"anda.\"\n"
"\n"
"Selepas setiap arahan, terangkan apa yang anda lihat:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Saya telah membuka tetapan.\"\n"
"- \"Saya boleh melihat pilihan itu.\"\n"
"- \"Saya tidak melihat butang itu.\"\n"
"- \"Menu nampak berbeza pada peranti saya.\"\n"
"- \"Ia meminta kata laluan.\"\n"
"- \"Peranti sedang memulakan semula sekarang.\"\n"
"- \"Saya telah menyelesaikan langkah itu.\"\n"
"- \"Ralat yang sama masih muncul.\"\n"
"- \"Nampaknya ia berfungsi sekarang.\"\n"
"\n"
"## Minta Ejen Melambatkan atau Menjelaskan\n"
"\n"
"Adalah normal untuk meminta ejen mengulangi satu arahan, terutamanya semasa "
"perbualan telefon.\n"
"\n"
"Ungkapan yang berguna termasuk:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Bolehkah anda ulangi itu, tolong?\"\n"
"- \"Bolehkah anda bercakap sedikit lebih perlahan?\"\n"
"- \"Apa yang saya sepatutnya klik seterusnya?\"\n"
"- \"Di mana boleh saya temukan tetapan itu?\"\n"
"- \"Adakah anda mengatakan 'mulakan semula' atau 'tetapkan semula'?\"\n"
"- \"Bolehkah anda mengeja perkataan itu?\"\n"
"- \"Haruskah saya tutup aplikasi dahulu?\"\n"
"- \"Adakah anda maksudkan butang di penjuru kanan atas?\"\n"
"- \"Bolehkah anda bimbing saya langkah demi langkah?\"\n"
"- \"Sila beri saya masa untuk mencari pilihan itu.\"\n"
"\n"
"Untuk mengesahkan satu arahan, berkata:\n"
"\n"
"> \"Jadi mula-mula saya tutup aplikasi ini, kemudian mula semula peranti. "
"Adakah itu betul?\"\n"
"\n"
"Ini membantu mencegah kesilapan dan menunjukkan bahawa anda mengikuti "
"dengan teliti.\n"
"\n"
"## Fahami Istilah Teknikal Umum\n"
"\n"
"Anda mungkin mendengar istilah ini semasa panggilan sokongan:\n"
"\n"
"- **Mulakan Semula** — matikan peranti atau aplikasi dan hidupkan semula\n"
"- **Tetapkan Semula** — kembalikan satu tetapan atau peranti kepada keadaan "
"terdahulu atau lalai\n"
"- **Kemas Kini** — pasang versi perisian yang lebih baru\n"
"- **Pasang Semula** — buang perisian dan pasangnya semula\n"
"- **Sambungan** — sambungan antara peranti dan rangkaian atau perkhidmatan\n"
"- **Pelayar** — aplikasi yang digunakan untuk membuka laman web\n"
"- **Cache** — data yang disimpan sementara yang boleh menyebabkan masalah\n"
"- **Kelayakan Akaun** — maklumat yang digunakan untuk mengakses akaun\n"
"- **Keizinan** — tetapan yang membenarkan satu aplikasi menggunakan ciri "
"atau data\n"
"- **Sandaran** — salinan simpan data penting\n"
"- **Tetapan Semula Kilang** — menghapuskan tetapan peribadi dan memulihkan "
"peranti kepada keadaan asalnya\n"
"- **Akses Jarak Jauh** — membenarkan orang lain atau program mengawal "
"peranti anda\n"
"- **Peningkatan** — memindahkan masalah kepada pasukan sokongan yang lebih "
"pakar\n"
"\n"
"Berhati-hati dengan perbezaan antara **mulakan semula** dan **tetapkan "
"semula**. Tetapan semula mungkin mengubah tetapan atau mengeluarkan data, "
"bergantung kepada jenis tetapan semula.\n"
"\n"
"## Sahkan Sebelum Langkah Berisiko\n"
"\n"
"Beberapa tindakan penyelesaian masalah mungkin menjejaskan fail, tetapan, "
"atau akaun anda.\n"
"\n"
"Sebelum meneruskan, tanya:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Adakah ini akan menghapuskan sebarang data saya?\"\n"
"- \"Haruskah saya membuat sandaran dahulu?\"\n"
"- \"Adakah saya perlu log masuk lagi?\"\n"
"- \"Adakah ini akan menetapkan semula semua tetapan saya?\"\n"
"- \"Bolehkah saya membatalkan langkah ini?\"\n"
"- \"Adakah terdapat pilihan yang lebih selamat yang boleh kita cuba "
"dahulu?\"\n"
"- \"Adakah memasang semula aplikasi ini akan menghapuskan fail-fail yang "
"saya simpan?\"\n"
"- \"Boleh anda terangkan apa yang langkah ini akan ubah?\"\n"
"\n"
"Jangan melaksanakan tetapan semula kilang, menghapuskan fail penting, atau "
"mengeluarkan satu akaun melainkan anda memahami akibatnya.\n"
"\n"
"## Lindungi Maklumat Peribadi Anda\n"
"\n"
"Seorang ejen sokongan yang sah mungkin perlu mengesahkan identiti anda, "
"tetapi anda perlu melindungi maklumat sensitif.\n"
"\n"
"Jangan kongsi:\n"
"\n"
"- Kata laluan lengkap anda\n"
"- Kod pengesahan satu kali kecuali anda memulakan dan memahami proses "
"tersebut\n"
"- Butiran kad pembayaran penuh anda tanpa alasan yang sah\n"
"- Frasa pemulihan atau kunci kriptografi peribadi\n"
"- Dokumen peribadi yang tidak perlu\n"
"- Akses jarak jauh kepada peranti anda melainkan anda mempercayai dan "
"menghubungi syarikat melalui saluran rasmi\n"
"\n"
"Anda boleh berkata:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Saya tidak selesa berkongsi kata laluan saya.\"\n"
"- \"Boleh anda mengesahkan identiti saya dengan cara lain?\"\n"
"- \"Kenapa anda memerlukan maklumat itu?\"\n"
"- \"Saya menghubungi anda melalui nombor sokongan rasmi.\"\n"
"- \"Saya lebih suka tidak memasang perisian akses jarak jauh.\"\n"
"- \"Bolehkah anda menghantar arahan melalui portal sokongan rasmi?\"\n"
"\n"
"Seorang ejen sokongan yang benar tidak perlu kata laluan akaun anda.\n"
"\n"
"## Uji Sama Ada Penyelesaian Berfungsi\n"
"\n"
"Selepas melengkapkan langkah penyelesaian masalah, uji tindakan asal sekali "
"lagi.\n"
"\n"
"Anda boleh berkata:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Biar saya cuba membuka aplikasi itu semula.\"\n"
"- \"Saya akan uji mikrofon sekarang.\"\n"
"- \"Halaman sedang memuatkan dengan betul.\"\n"
"- \"Kesalahan itu masih disana.\"\n"
"- \"Sambungan kini lebih stabil.\"\n"
"- \"Ia berfungsi, tetapi masih lebih perlahan daripada biasa.\"\n"
"- \"Masalah asal sudah diperbaiki.\"\n"
"- \"Masalah itu kembali selepas beberapa minit.\"\n"
"\n"
"Tunjukkan secara khusus apa yang berubah:\n"
"\n"
"> \"Saya kini boleh log masuk, tetapi saya masih tidak boleh memuat naik "
"fail.\"\n"
"\n"
"Ini memberitahu ejen bahawa satu bahagian isu telah diselesaikan manakala "
"yang lain masih ada.\n"
"\n"
"## Tanya tentang Punca\n"
"\n"
"Setelah isu itu diperbaiki, anda mungkin ingin memahami mengapa ia berlaku "
"dan cara mencegahnya.\n"
"\n"
"Soalan berguna termasuk:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Adakah anda tahu apa yang menyebabkan masalah ini?\"\n"
"- \"Adakah ini berkaitan dengan kemas kini terbaru?\"\n"
"- \"Adakah ini isu yang diketahui?\"\n"
"- \"Adakah ia boleh berlaku lagi?\"\n"
"- \"Adakah ada yang perlu saya lakukan untuk mencegahnya?\"\n"
"- \"Haruskah saya biarkan tetapan ini tetap diaktifkan?\"\n"
"- \"Perlukah saya memasang kemas kini lain?\"\n"
"- \"Di mana saya boleh memeriksa status perkhidmatan?\"\n"
"\n"
"Ejen mungkin tidak tahu punca yang tepat dengan segera, tetapi mereka "
"mungkin memberikan penerangan atau langkah pencegahan yang mungkin.\n"
"\n"
"## Meminta Pemindahan atau Sokongan Lanjut\n"
"\n"
"Kadang-kadang ejen sokongan pertama tidak dapat menyelesaikan masalah.\n"
"\n"
"Anda boleh tanya:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Bolehkah anda meningkatkan isu ini?\"\n"
"- \"Bolehkah saya bercakap dengan pakar teknikal?\"\n"
"- \"Bolehkah anda membuat tiket sokongan?\"\n"
"- \"Apa yang terjadi seterusnya?\"\n"
"- \"Bilakah saya boleh menjangka kemas kini?\"\n"
"- \"Bagaimana pasukan anda akan menghubungi saya?\"\n"
"- \"Adakah terdapat nombor rujukan untuk kes ini?\"\n"
"- \"Adakah saya perlu memberikan maklumat tambahan lain?\"\n"
"- \"Perlukah saya membalas jika saya tidak menerima maklum balas?\"\n"
"\n"
"Jika ejen membuat satu tiket, sahkan:\n"
"\n"
"- Nombor tiket atau kes\n"
"- Tindakan seterusnya\n"
"- Siapa yang akan menghubungi anda\n"
"- Kaedah komunikasi yang dijangka\n"
"- Sama ada anda perlu menjaga peranti tersebut tetap tersedia\n"
"\n"
"Sebagai contoh:\n"
"\n"
"> \"Bolehkah anda ulangi nombor tiket dan terangkan apa yang akan berlaku "
"seterusnya?\"\n"
"\n"
"## Meminta Penggantian, Pengembalian Wang, atau Pembetulan\n"
"\n"
"Jika penyelesaian masalah tidak dapat menyelesaikan masalah, langkah "
"seterusnya mungkin melibatkan pembetulan, penggantian, atau pengembalian "
"wang.\n"
"\n"
"Soalan berguna termasuk:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Adakah peranti ini masih dalam jaminan?\"\n"
"- \"Bolehkah produk ini diperbaiki?\"\n"
"- \"Adakah saya layak mendapatkan penggantian?\"\n"
"- \"Bolehkah saya memohon pengembalian wang?\"\n"
"- \"Berapa lama pembetulan akan berlaku?\"\n"
"- \"Adakah saya perlu hantar peranti itu kepada anda?\"\n"
"- \"Adakah anda akan menyediakan label pengiriman?\"\n"
"- \"Adakah saya akan menerima penggantian sementara?\"\n"
"- \"Adakah terdapat bayaran pembetulan?\"\n"
"\n"
"Anda mungkin perlu memberikan:\n"
"\n"
"- Bukti pembelian\n"
"- Nombor siri\n"
"- Tarikh pembelian\n"
"- Foto atau video yang menunjukkan isu tersebut\n"
"- Pembungkusan asal\n"
"\n"
"## Tamatkan Panggilan Secara Jelas\n"
"\n"
"Sebelum menamatkan perbualan, rumuskan hasil dan langkah seterusnya.\n"
"\n"
"Anda boleh berkata:\n"
"\n"
"- \"Jadi masalah ini kini diselesaikan, betul?\"\n"
"- \"Biar saya sahkan apa yang perlu saya lakukan seterusnya.\"\n"
"- \"Anda akan menghantar e-mel kepada saya dalam masa dua hari kerja.\"\n"
"- \"Nombor tiket saya adalah 48271, betul?\"\n"
"- \"Saya perlu menghubungi anda sekali lagi jika masalah ini kembali.\"\n"
"- \"Adakah ada perkara lain yang perlu saya lakukan?\"\n"
"- \"Terima kasih kerana memandu saya melalui langkah-langkah ini.\"\n"
"- \"Terima kasih atas bantuan anda.\"\n"
"\n"
"Jika masalahnya tidak diselesaikan, pastikan anda tahu apa yang akan "
"berlaku seterusnya.\n"
"\n"
"## Satu Perbualan Sokongan Mudah\n"
"\n"
"Perbualan tipikal mungkin seperti ini:\n"
"\n"
"> **Ejen:** Sokongan Teknikal. Bagaimana saya boleh membantu anda hari ini?\n"
"> **Pemanggil:** Komputer riba saya tidak dapat sambung ke Wi-Fi rumah "
"saya. Ia boleh melihat rangkaian, tetapi sambungan gagal.\n"
"> **Ejen:** Bilakah masalah ini bermula?\n"
"> **Pemanggil:** Kira-kira sejam yang lalu. Ia berfungsi seperti biasa pagi "
"ini.\n"
"> **Ejen:** Adakah anda telah memulakan semula komputer riba dan penghala?\n"
"> **Pemanggil:** Saya memulakan semula komputer riba itu, tetapi bukan "
"penghala. Boleh anda terangkan bagaimana untuk melakukannya dengan selamat?\n"
"> **Ejen:** Sudah tentu. Nyahpasang penghala dari kuasa, tunggu tiga puluh "
"saat, dan pasang semula.\n"
"> **Pemanggil:** Adakah itu akan mengubah sebarang tetapan rangkaian saya?\n"
"> **Ejen:** Tidak, ia hanya akan memulakan semula penghala.\n"
"> **Pemanggil:** Baiklah. Saya telah menyambungkannya semula. Lampu-lampu "
"sedang menyala semula sekarang.\n"
"> **Ejen:** Sila cuba sambung komputer riba anda sekali lagi.\n"
"> **Pemanggil:** Ia berfungsi sekarang. Adakah anda tahu apa yang "
"menyebabkan masalah ini?\n"
"> **Ejen:** Penghala mungkin kehilangan sambungan sementara.\n"
"> **Pemanggil:** Faham. Terima kasih atas bantuan anda.\n"
"\n"
"## Formula Sokongan Mudah\n"
"\n"
"Apabila menghubungi sokongan teknikal, ikuti struktur ini:\n"
"\n"
"1. **Kenal pasti produk:** Terangkan peranti, aplikasi, atau perkhidmatan "
"yang anda gunakan.\n"
"2. **Huraikan matlamat:** Katakan apa yang anda cuba lakukan.\n"
"3. **Terangkan masalah:** Terangkan apa yang berlaku sebaliknya.\n"
"4. **Tambah konteks:** Katakan bila ia bermula dan sama ada ia berlaku "
"berulang kali.\n"
"5. **Senaraikan percubaan sebelum ini:** Terangkan apa yang anda telah "
"cuba.\n"
"6. **Ikuti satu langkah pada satu masa:** Sahkan setiap arahan sebelum "
"meneruskan.\n"
"7. **Uji hasilnya:** Cuba tindakan asal sekali lagi.\n"
"8. **Sahkan hasilnya:** Tanya tentang punca, pencegahan, atau langkah "
"seterusnya.\n"
"\n"
"Sebagai contoh:\n"
"\n"
"> \"Saya menggunakan aplikasi mudah alih anda pada telefon Android. Saya "
"cuba log masuk, tetapi aplikasi menutup selepas saya memasukkan kata laluan "
"saya. Masalah ini bermula selepas kemas kini semalam, dan memulakan semula "
"telefon tidak membantu.\"\n"
"\n"
"## Senario Latihan\n"
"\n"
"Dalam permainan peranan ini, anda sedang memanggil TechEase Support "
"mengenai masalah teknikal. Ejen bantuan AI akan mengemukakan soalan, "
"membimbing anda melalui langkah-langkah penyelesaian masalah, dan membantu "
"menentukan apa yang perlu dilakukan seterusnya.\n"
"\n"
"Semasa perbualan, cuba untuk:\n"
"\n"
"- Jelaskan peranti atau perkhidmatan yang anda gunakan.\n"
"- Terangkan apa yang anda harapkan dan apa yang berlaku sebaliknya.\n"
"- Katakan bila isu ini bermula.\n"
"- Laporkan mesej ralat atau simptom spesifik lain.\n"
"- Terangkan apa yang anda telah cuba.\n"
"- Minta ejen menjelaskan sekurang-kurangnya satu arahan.\n"
"- Sahkan sama ada satu langkah penyelesaian masalah mengubah apa-apa.\n"
"- Meminta nombor tiket atau sokongan lanjut jika masalahnya masih tidak "
"dapat diselesaikan.\n"
"\n"
"Fokus pada menjadi jelas dan spesifik. Anda tidak perlu mempunyai "
"pengetahuan teknikal yang maju atau tatabahasa yang sempurna untuk "
"mempunyai perbualan sokongan yang berjaya."

