#: src/features/Landing/LandingPage.tsx:115
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"FluencyPal is a browser-based app, so you only need an internet browser to "
"use it. You can run FluencyPal on a mobile phone, tablet, or desktop "
"without installing anything."
msgstr ""
"FluencyPal ialah aplikasi berasaskan pelayar, jadi anda hanya memerlukan "
"pelayar internet untuk menggunakannya. Anda boleh menjalankan FluencyPal "
"pada telefon bimbit, tablet, atau desktop tanpa memasang apa-apa."

#: src/features/Landing/LandingPage.tsx:37
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"FluencyPal is an AI-powered conversation practice app designed for "
"intermediate and advanced learners. It helps you improve speaking fluency, "
"pronunciation, and confidence through realistic conversations and instant "
"feedback."
msgstr ""
"FluencyPal adalah aplikasi latihan perbualan yang dikuasakan oleh AI, "
"direka untuk pelajar peringkat pertengahan dan lanjutan. Ia membantu anda "
"meningkatkan kefasihan bercakap, sebutan, dan keyakinan melalui perbualan "
"yang realistik dan maklum balas serta-merta."

#: src/features/Landing/LandingPage.tsx:58
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"FluencyPal is best suited for learners who can hold basic conversations and "
"want to improve fluency, accuracy, and confidence. It works well for "
"pre-intermediate, intermediate, and advanced speakers and adapts to your "
"level over time."
msgstr ""
"FluencyPal amat sesuai untuk pelajar yang boleh mengadakan perbualan asas "
"dan ingin meningkatkan kefasihan, ketepatan, dan keyakinan. Ia berfungsi "
"dengan baik untuk penutur pada tahap pra-pertengahan, pertengahan, dan "
"lanjutan serta menyesuaikan dengan tahap anda dari masa ke masa."

#: src/features/Landing/LandingPage.tsx:129
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"FluencyPal is designed to help you practice speaking and build confidence, "
"not to replace a human teacher. It works best as a daily speaking companion "
"that helps you practice more often, get instant feedback, and prepare for "
"real conversations."
msgstr ""
"FluencyPal direka untuk membantu anda berlatih bercakap dan membina "
"keyakinan, bukan untuk menggantikan guru manusia. Ia berfungsi dengan baik "
"sebagai teman bercakap harian yang membantu anda berlatih lebih kerap, "
"mendapatkan maklum balas segera, dan bersedia untuk perbualan sebenar."

#: src/features/Landing/LandingPage.tsx:86
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"FluencyPal is focused on speaking practice. You can use voice mode and "
"optionally enable webcam feedback with an AI avatar to make conversations "
"feel more realistic and engaging, while receiving feedback on your speaking "
"performance."
msgstr ""
"FluencyPal menumpukan kepada latihan bertutur. Anda boleh menggunakan mod "
"suara dan secara opsional mengaktifkan maklum balas webcam dengan avatar AI "
"untuk membuat percakapan terasa lebih realistik dan menarik, sambil "
"menerima maklum balas tentang prestasi pertuturan anda."

#: src/features/RolePlay/fullArticles/alias/AliasLandingPage.tsx:77
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "FluencyPal offers a "
msgstr "FluencyPal menawarkan satu "

#: src/features/Landing/LandingPage.tsx:101
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"FluencyPal offers several learning modes: Casual Conversation for "
"uninterrupted speaking practice, Talk & Correct for instant grammar and "
"pronunciation feedback, Role-Play Scenarios for real-life situations, as "
"well as grammar practice, vocabulary building, and progress tracking."
msgstr ""
"FluencyPal menawarkan beberapa mod pembelajaran: Percakapan Santai untuk "
"latihan bercakap tanpa gangguan, Bicara & Betulkan untuk maklum balas "
"tatabahasa dan sebutan serta-merta, Senario Main Peranan untuk situasi "
"kehidupan sebenar, serta latihan tatabahasa, pembinaan kosa kata, dan "
"penjejakan kemajuan."

#: src/features/Landing/LandingPage.tsx:51
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"FluencyPal offers weekly, monthly, or yearly access, giving you full access "
"to all features. No auto-renew. You pay each month by hand, or you don't. "
"We never charge you while you're not using it."
msgstr ""
"FluencyPal menawarkan akses mingguan, bulanan, atau tahunan, memberikan "
"anda akses penuh kepada semua ciri. Tiada auto-pembaharuan. Anda membayar "
"setiap bulan secara manual, atau tidak. Kami tidak pernah mengenakan "
"bayaran kepada anda semasa anda tidak menggunakannya."

#: src/features/Landing/LandingPage.tsx:122
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"FluencyPal stores conversation transcripts in its database to improve your "
"learning experience. You can permanently delete your personal data at any "
"time from the app settings. Voice processing is handled using OpenAI "
"services, and FluencyPal does not store your voice recordings. Webcam data "
"is not stored either — it is processed in real time by the AI and then "
"immediately discarded."
msgstr ""
"FluencyPal menyimpan transkrip perbualan dalam pangkalan datanya untuk "
"meningkatkan pengalaman pembelajaran anda. Anda boleh memadamkan data "
"peribadi anda secara kekal pada bila-bila masa dari tetapan aplikasi. "
"Pemprosesan suara dikendalikan menggunakan perkhidmatan OpenAI, dan "
"FluencyPal tidak menyimpan rakaman suara anda. Data kamera web juga tidak "
"disimpan — ia diproses secara masa nyata oleh AI dan kemudian segera "
"dibuang."

#: src/features/Landing/LandingPage.tsx:136
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"FluencyPal tracks your activity and completed tasks over time. As you "
"practice regularly, conversations become more complex, and feedback adapts "
"to your level, helping you notice improvements in fluency, confidence, and "
"accuracy. FluencyPal also assesses your grammar, confidence, vocabulary, "
"and fluency, then creates a progress chart so you can see how your skills "
"grow over time."
msgstr ""
"FluencyPal menjejaki aktiviti dan tugasan yang telah anda selesaikan dari "
"masa ke masa. Apabila anda berlatih secara kerap, perbualan menjadi lebih "
"kompleks, dan maklum balas disesuaikan dengan tahap anda, membantu anda "
"melihat peningkatan dalam kefasihan, keyakinan, dan ketepatan. FluencyPal "
"juga menilai tatabahasa, keyakinan, perbendaharaan kata, dan kefasihan "
"anda, kemudian memberikan carta kemajuan supaya anda dapat melihat "
"bagaimana kemahiran anda berkembang dari masa ke masa."

