#: src/features/Blog/blogData.tsx:73
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"I recognize this feeling.\n"
"\n"
"I know my own stranger can be wrong. It happens. But rarely enough that "
"questioning him feels awkward. When his answers are structured, articulate, "
"confident, I hesitate. Asking, “Are you absolutely sure?” can feel almost "
"inappropriate — as if I am wasting his time, or exposing my own ignorance.\n"
"\n"
"My stranger is not a person.\n"
"\n"
"We usually call him ChatGPT. And that is where the parallel becomes "
"difficult to ignore.\n"
"\n"
"On the surface, he is easier to “read” than any human being. His tone is "
"stable. His politeness is predictable. His structure is clean. There are no "
"trembling hands, no nervous pauses, no visible signs of hesitation.\n"
"\n"
"That stability may itself create a problem.\n"
"\n"
"In humans, inner doubt often leaks into outward expression. We hear it in "
"hesitation, see it in posture, sense it in tone. With AI, that link is "
"absent. Its voice remains steady regardless of uncertainty. The certainty "
"you hear comes from the way it is built.\n"
"\n"
"You can ask it how to cook “pork wings,” and it may calmly provide a recipe "
"- even if the premise itself is absurd."
msgstr ""
"Saya mengenali perasaan ini.\n"
"\n"
"Saya tahu orang asing saya boleh salah. Ia berlaku. Tetapi cukup jarang "
"sehingga mempertikaikannya terasa kekok. Apabila jawapannya terstruktur, "
"berhujah dengan jelas, yakin, saya teragak-agak. Bertanya, “Adakah anda "
"benar-benar pasti?” boleh terasa hampir tidak sesuai - seolah-olah saya "
"membuang masanya, atau mendedahkan kejahilan saya sendiri.\n"
"\n"
"Orang asing saya bukanlah seorang manusia.\n"
"\n"
"Kami biasanya memanggilnya ChatGPT. Dan itulah di mana persamaannya menjadi "
"sukar diabaikan.\n"
"\n"
"Pada luaran, dia lebih mudah untuk \"dibaca\" berbanding mana-mana manusia. "
"Nada suaranya stabil. Kesopanannya boleh dijangka. Strukturnya bersih. "
"Tiada tangan terketar-ketar, tiada jeda gugup, tiada tanda-tanda keraguan "
"yang kelihatan.\n"
"\n"
"Kestabilan itu sendiri mungkin mencipta masalah.\n"
"\n"
"Dalam manusia, keraguan dalaman seringkali terzahir melalui ungkapan "
"luaran. Kita mendengarnya dalam keraguan, melihatnya dalam perlakuan, "
"merasakannya dalam nada suara. Dengan AI, pautan itu tidak ada. Suaranya "
"kekal tenang tanpa mengira ketidakpastian. Kepastian yang anda dengar "
"datang dari cara ia dibina.\n"
"\n"
"Anda boleh bertanya kepadanya bagaimana cara memasak \"sayap daging babi,\" "
"dan ia mungkin dengan tenang menyediakan resipi - walaupun premis itu "
"sendiri adalah tidak masuk akal."

